      );\n      const proof = yield* CloudflareHostedProof;\n      const config = yield* Schema.decodeEffect(PropagationRequest)({\n        attempts: 2,\n        delayMs: 10,\n        hydrationTimeoutMs: 200,\n        origin: HttpServer.formatAddress(server.address),\n      });\n      const fiber = yield* proof\n        .verifyAssetPropagation(config)\n        .pipe(Effect.forkChild({ startImmediately: true }));\n      expect(yield* Deferred.await(started)).toBe(true);\n      yield* Fiber.interrupt(fiber);\n      expect(\n        yield* Deferred.await(retired).pipe(Effect.timeout(\"5 seconds\"))\n      ).toBe(true);\n    }).pipe(Effect.provide(Layer.merge(proofLayer, serverLayer))),\n  10_000\n);\napps/docs/README.md:90:bun run --filter=docs test:cloudflare-hosted\napps/docs/README.md:91:bun run --filter=docs test:scripts\napps/docs/README.md:133:the hosted-proof policy and real browser adapter fixtures. The server test configuration resolves both\napps/docs/README.md:166:cleanliness or hosted behavior.\napps/docs/README.md:187:it. Final hosted requalification of the exact retirement candidate and the\napps/docs/README.md:207:`prod` stage and the same allowlisted upload owner. No hosted Doppler fetch is\napps/docs/README.md:212:belong below `docs/evidence/deployments/`. The hosted harness requires the\napps/docs/README.md:221:Schema-owned branded types; their encoded text stays unchanged. The named `CloudflareHostedProof` service keeps Playwright objects private in\napps/docs/README.md:232:The hosted operation has one five-minute deadline. Browser event callbacks only\napps/docs/README.md:250:runtime headers and HTML do not establish Worker or hosted behaviour.\napps/docs/README.md:252:credential-free Production hosted verification workflow can recheck an\napps/docs/README.md:258:`d9cb894…` passed the corrected hosted, screenshot and pre-mutation contracts,\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:54:`@taxkit/scripts` exports and commands, and the standalone API ru