{"timestamp":"2026-10-04T15:02:32.650Z","ordinal":12982,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a1055e-488d-75e2-ab79-097882eda37b","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-8c023622-5e6c-41f0-93e5-32d1e694ef06","process_id":"20449","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json\np=Path('apps/docs/README.md');s=p.read_text().replace('and\\nthe hosted-proof policy and real browser adapter fixtures.', 'and\\nthe built/hosted-proof policy and real browser adapter fixtures.');anchor='browser/workerd cleanup. `test:cloudflare-built` remains an explicit alias for';s=s.replace(anchor,'''browser/workerd cleanup. Its native Command entry calls the closed\n`LocalCloudflareBuiltProof` service; Playwright objects stay inside its private\nadapter. Config acquires only the existing allowlisted local environment, and\nnative filesystem, HTTP, Crypto and child-process streams own the work. Each\noutput pipe has a 1 MiB limit; generated artifact reads have a 64 MiB limit and\n10,000-file ceiling. Sorted path/NUL/file bytes/NUL digests retain the previous\nartifact identity. One five-minute deadline covers the entire operation, with\na two-minute browser limit. Scoped cleanup completes before the whole owning\nreceipt Schema is encoded, saved and read back. Requested screenshot cardinality\nand both receipt/manifest readbacks are checked. `test:cloudflare-built` remains an explicit alias for''');p.write_text(s)\np=Path('docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md');s=p.read_text();s+='''\n\nThe local built Worker proof has its own closed `LocalCloudflareBuiltProof`\nservice, whole receipt/screenshot Schemas and native Command entry at the\nexisting path. Native filesystem, Config, Crypto, HTTP, monotonic time and\nchild-process streams own orchestration. Private SDK objects never enter its\npublic reply. Both process pipes drain alongside exit, with a 1 MiB cap per\npipe. Artifact reads stop at 64 MiB even when metadata understates a growing\nfile; total artifact/digest size and 10,000-file ceilings bound collection.\nThe five-minute operation and two-minute browser deadlines preserve scoped\ncleanup. Recorded child identity must disappear, and browser work completes\nbefore the receipt is saved and read back.\n\nNative fixtures check exact UTF-8 output limits, real child termination after\nan overflowing pipe, nonzero exit, total timeout, independent path/NUL/opaque\nbyte digests, growing artifact limits, whole receipt decoding and readback,\nscreenshot cardinality and no writes after a late cleanup defect. Controlled\nChromium fixtures check the exact malformed JSON body, navigation without a\ndocument reload, delayed pending state, focus/contrast/mobile/motion,\nscreenshots, private diagnostics, event overflow and actual pending-response\nretirement. The controlled fixture has two browser fetches and a separate\nmalformed API request; these counts are kept separate. These fixtures do not\nprove the generated Worker or any provider environment. The real built local\nworkerd command supplies separate Worker/assets/concurrent-request evidence.\nActual strict CLI checks cover every adopted source/test/command and a rejected\nneighbour; source counterexamples guard bounds, digests, cleanup, encoding and\nreadback. A draft PR and local proof do not finish DEV-73.\n''';p.write_text(s)\nreceipt='docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-05-native-built-worker-proof.json'\ndata={'document_type':'migration-receipt','date':'2026-10-05','issue':'DEV-73','parent_revision':'b2a556c8818a83fdfe97d79709bbda0d89b4b8db','status':'implementation-in-progress','authority':{'principal':'Cooper Corbett','operation':'local implementation, tested commits, pushes and draft PRs','repository':'crcorbett/taxkit','environment':'local pinned macOS/Bun/Chromium; no provider apply','excluded':['merge','deployment','publication','provider apply','version application','Medicare correction']},'implemented':['Native Command and closed named LocalCloudflareBuiltProof service with Schema-owned options/errors/full receipt/manifest','Native Config filtered environment, filesystem, HTTP, Crypto, child-process bounded streams, monotonic time, scoped cleanup and finite deadlines','Private Playwright adapter with immutable Ref observations, bounded callback queues and actual browser failures/interruption','Preserved local Wrangler arguments, command aliases, sorted path/NUL/content/NUL digest bytes, sixteen assertions and original receipt fields','Exact canonical strict selectors/runtime/codec admissions, actual CLI fixtures and source counterexamples'],'checks':[],'documentation_impact':{'Change required':['apps/docs/README.md','docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md','docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md','docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json','oxlint.config.ts','tools/oxlint/portable-rules.test.ts','tools/docs-deployment/strict-boundaries.policy.ts','tools/docs-deployment/strict-boundaries.contract.test.ts','apps/docs/tsconfig.scripts.json','apps/docs/vitest.scripts.config.ts'],'Preserve':['public content/runtime','installed dependencies and lockfile','command/output/screenshot paths and historical receipts','canonical skills/digests','provider state and all retained tax results'],'N/A':{'Changeset':'private unversioned app; no package-facing change','new runbook or provider operation':'same local-only command and authority boundary','generated/public content':'unchanged'}},'recovery':{'failed_observations':['Initial real-browser failure remains unexplained; subsequent phase-logged and unlogged screenshot runs pass','Removing temporary logging initially left a syntax error; corrected and retained','Initial native test APIs/types/tuple readback and formatted replacement mismatches corrected before acceptance','Initial controlled browser count expected three; fixture has two actual browser fetches plus separate malformed POST','Initial pending-response interruption fixture lacked its own scope; corrected to scope the interrupted operation','Initial growing-file fixture used unavailable Stream.repeatValue; installed native Stream.range owns the corrected fixture'],'rollback':'revert this complete slice to parent revision','resume_trigger':'finish this slice and remaining T002 semantic/enforcement review, then DEV-74–81 in accepted order','next_owner':'TaxKit implementation owner'},'limitations':['Whole-repository qualification remains pending','Local fixtures are not generated Worker/provider proof','No live Workers URL/provider apply/deployment/merge/publication/version application','Playwright has no AbortSignal; cleanup is proven separately through actual pending HTTP retirement','DEV-73 and DEV-74–81 remain unfinished; Medicare separate'],'postconditions':[],'logs_location':'Task-local pinned-toolchain directory; portable basenames only'}\nPath(receipt).write_text(json.dumps(data,indent=2)+'\\n')\np=Path('docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json');d=json.loads(p.read_text());print('root keys',list(d));\nfor t in d['tasks']:\n if t['id']=='CSF-T002':\n  key=next(k for k,v in t.items() if isinstance(v,list) and 'docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-05-hosted-docs-native-proof.json' in v);t[key].append(receipt)\np.write_text(json.dumps(d,indent=2)+'\\n')\nPY\nPATH=/private/tmp/taxkit-local-toolchain/bun-darwin-aarch64:$PATH node_modules/.bin/oxfmt -c oxfmt.config.ts --write apps/docs/scripts/cloudflare-built* apps/docs/scripts/test-cloudflare-built.tsx apps/docs/tsconfig.scripts.json apps/docs/vitest.scripts.config.ts oxlint.config.ts tools/oxlint/portable-rules.test.ts tools/docs-deployment/strict-boundaries*.ts > /private/tmp/taxkit-local-toolchain/built-native-pre-root-format.log 2>&1\nPATH=/private/tmp/taxkit-local-toolchain/bun-darwin-aarch64:$PATH node_modules/.bin/oxlint -c oxlint.config.ts apps/docs/scripts/cloudflare-built* apps/docs/scripts/test-cloudflare-built.tsx tools/docs-deployment/strict-boundaries*.ts oxlint.config.ts tools/oxlint/portable-rules.test.ts --disable-nested-config > /private/tmp/taxkit-local-toolchain/built-native-pre-root-lint.log 2>&1"],"cwd":"file:///Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json\np=Path('apps/docs/README.md');s=p.read_text().replace('and\\nthe hosted-proof policy and real browser adapter fixtures.', 'and\\nthe built/hosted-proof policy and real browser adapter fixtures.');anchor='browser/workerd cleanup. `test:cloudflare-built` remains an explicit alias for';s=s.replace(anchor,'''browser/workerd cleanup. Its native Command entry calls the closed\n`LocalCloudflareBuiltProof` service; Playwright objects stay inside its private\nadapter. Config acquires only the existing allowlisted local environment, and\nnative filesystem, HTTP, Crypto and child-process streams own the work. Each\noutput pipe has a 1 MiB limit; generated artifact reads have a 64 MiB limit and\n10,000-file ceiling. Sorted path/NUL/file bytes/NUL digests retain the previous\nartifact identity. One five-minute deadline covers the entire operation, with\na two-minute browser limit. Scoped cleanup completes before the whole owning\nreceipt Schema is encoded, saved and read back. Requested screenshot cardinality\nand both receipt/manifest readbacks are checked. `test:cloudflare-built` remains an explicit alias for''');p.write_text(s)\np=Path('docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md');s=p.read_text();s+='''\n\nThe local built Worker proof has its own closed `LocalCloudflareBuiltProof`\nservice, whole receipt/screenshot Schemas and native Command entry at the\nexisting path. Native filesystem, Config, Crypto, HTTP, monotonic time and\nchild-process streams own orchestration. Private SDK objects never enter its\npublic reply. Both process pipes drain alongside exit, with a 1 MiB cap