{"timestamp":"2026-10-04T15:13:08.346Z","ordinal":13206,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_06b7a884f26959d3016ac26cfe7dcc87d09fe333c1f9210b17","status":"completed","call_id":"call_FZXn6rtN5p7LaLo8vVduyDbx","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"cat > /private/tmp/taxkit-local-toolchain/built-native-pr-body.md <<'EOF'\\nThe built docs check now owns its local Worker and browser lifetimes through a closed Effect service. Native configuration, file reading, hashing, HTTP and child-process streams replace the previous orchestration. Output and artifact limits, finite deadlines and cleanup checks prevent incomplete work from producing a success receipt.\\n\\nThe existing command aliases, sixteen behavioural assertions, receipt fields, screenshot paths and sorted path/NUL/file bytes/NUL hashes are preserved. The command saves and reads back evidence only after cleanup. Private browser objects stay inside the adapter; callback queue overflow, unexpected diagnostics and late cleanup failure cannot produce a clean observation.\\n\\nValidation:\\n- Frozen Bun 1.4.2 install: 792 installs across 1020 packages, no dependency changes.\\n- All 24 package test tasks; 53 docs script and 19 server tests; 378 actual lint CLI tests; 40 source contract controls.\\n- All 15 builds and full verification, including 30 Quality tests with 11 isolated checks, both unused-code profiles and all 24 compiler tasks.\\n- Actual generated local workerd/Chromium proof with nine concurrent requests, one shared context, three server functions, no document reloads/diagnostics and both screenshots.\\n- Independent hash fixtures, actual child termination, growing-file stream bounds, browser interruption, receipt readback and a reverted malformed-JSON mutation that fails the exact HTTP-body assertion.\\n\\nNo Changeset: this is a private, unversioned app check. Local proof does not establish a provider deployment. DEV-73 remains in progress while final whole-source scope/fixture containment and semantic review finish; DEV-74–81 follow the accepted order. Retained tax results and the pending Medicare decision are unchanged. No merge, deployment, publication, provider apply or version application.\\nEOF\",\"max_output_tokens\":1000}));\ntext(await tools.write_stdin({session_id:31379,chars:\"\",\"yield_time_ms\":1000,\"max_output_tokens\":1800}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"gh pr create --repo crcorbett/taxkit --draft --base codex/dev-73-hosted-docs-native-proof --head codex/dev-73-native-built-worker-proof --title 'Keep local docs checks bounded and clean up their processes' --body-file /private/tmp/taxkit-local-toolchain/built-native-pr-body.md\",\"sandbox_permissions\":\"require_escalated\",\"justification\":\"Create the authorised reviewable draft PR for the tested local docs Worker proof migration.\",\"max_output_tokens\":1200,\"yield_time_ms\":1000}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1055e-488d-75e2-ab79-097882eda37b","create_time":1791126757.262851}}}
