tings are missing or invalid.\\\",\\n        operation: \\\"settings\\\",\\n        runtime: \\\"client\\\",\\n      })\\n  )\\n);\\n\\nexport const TaxKitWebClientConfigProviderLive = ConfigProvider.layer(\\n  ConfigProvider.fromEnv({ env: __TAXKIT_WEB_CLIENT_INPUT__ }).pipe(\\n    ConfigProvider.constantCase\\n  )\\n);\\n{\\n  \\\"document_type\\\": \\\"migration-receipt\\\",\\n  \\\"date\\\": \\\"2026-10-05\\\",\\n  \\\"issue\\\": \\\"DEV-73\\\",\\n  \\\"parent_revision\\\": \\\"cd5b2a8dec1fdd53375486852485a898215d9ede\\\",\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"locally-qualified\\\",\\n  \\\"authority\\\": {\\n    \\\"principal\\\": \\\"Cooper Corbett\\\",\\n    \\\"operation\\\": \\\"local implementation, tested commits, pushes and draft PRs\\\",\\n    \\\"repository\\\": \\\"crcorbett/taxkit\\\",\\n    \\\"environment\\\": \\\"local pinned macOS/Bun/Chromium; no provider operation\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"implemented\\\": [\\n    \\\"Canonical whole-source selector covers six extensions across current/future owned root/app/tool/config files\\\",\\n    \\\"Five exact unexecuted lint-only inputs preserve isolated host/binding-rule contexts; neighbouring files remain strict\\\",\\n    \\\"Actual six-extension and five-neighbour admission/rejection controls with exact file count and expected rules\\\",\\n    \\\"Valid CommonJS positive/negative fixtures, separately from ESM syntax\\\",\\n    \\\"Two new isolated real-verifier mutations reject removed whole-source coverage and broadened fixture exclusions; existing controls/deadlines preserved\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"checks\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"native lint/Quality compiler projects\\\",\\n      \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"pass\\\",\\n      \\\"logs\\\": [\\n        \\\"owned-source-qualified-lint-types.log\\\",\\n        \\\"owned-source-qualified-quality-types.log\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"bun run lint / explicit Git-owned canonical CLI inventory\\\",\\n      \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"pass: 397 admitted owned source paths, zero warnings/errors or inventory diagnostics; all staged additions included\\\",\\n      \\\"logs\\\": [\\n        \\\"owned-source-root-lint.log\\\",\\n        \\\"2026-10-05-canonical-owned-source-inventory.json\\\",\\n        \\\"2026-10-05-canonical-owned-source-inventory.stderr\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"bun run test:oxlint / bun run test\\\",\\n      \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"401 actual CLI lint cases pass; all 24 package tasks, 23 matching caches; unchanged docs script/server cases 53/19 rerun\\\",\\n      \\\"logs\\\": [\\n        \\\"owned-source-cli-tests-qualified.log\\\",\\n        \\\"owned-source-root-tests.log\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"bun run build\\\",\\n      \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"all 15 tasks pass, matching caches; no app/package implementation change\\\",\\n      \\\"logs\\\": [\\n        \\\"owned-source-root-build.log\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"bun run verification\\\",\\n      \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"32 Quality cases pass, including 13 isolated checks in 360.78 seconds; new source/exclusion regressions fail the real verifier with exact intended messages; 206 deployment-tool, 21 skill and 16 evaluation cases; both Knip profiles and all 24 compiler tasks pass; unchanged SDK/browser 24 and web/browser four matching caches\\\",\\n      \\\"logs\\\": [\\n        \\\"owned-source-full-verification.log\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"bun install --frozen-lockfile\\\",\\n      \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"pass: unchanged 792 installs/1020 packages; native compiler replacement hash matches\\\",\\n      \\\"logs\\\": [\\n        \\\"owned-source-frozen-install.log\\\"\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"documentation_impact\\\": {\\n    \\\"Change required\\\": [\\n      \\\"oxlint.config.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"tools/oxlint/portable-rules.test.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"tools/quality-workflow/schemas.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"tools/quality-workflow/release-boundary.test.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"tools/quality-workflow/fixtures/strict-enforcement-defects.json\\\",\\n      \\\"docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md\\\",\\n      \\\"docs/standards/controls.md\\\",\\n      \\\"docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md\\\",\\n      \\\"docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json\\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\\"Preserve\\\": [\\n      \\\"All canonical rule severities and narrow runtime/codec/assignment/method admissions\\\",\\n      \\\"Explicit generated/vendor exclusions and MDX expression owner\\\",\\n      \\\"Canonical skills/digests, installed dependencies, public content, historical evidence, provider state and retained tax results\\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\\"N/A\\\": {\\n      \\\"Changeset\\\": \\\"repository tooling only; no package contract change\\\",\\n      \\\"runbook/provider operation\\\": \\\"same local verification commands; no consequential operation\\\",\\n      \\\"new public/generated output\\\": \\\"unchanged\\\"\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\\"fixture_containment\\\": {\\n    \\\"paths\\\": [\\n      \\\"tools/oxlint/fixtures/bun-accepted.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"tools/oxlint/fixtures/bun-global-non-host-accepted.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"tools/oxlint/fixtures/bun-unrelated-accepted.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"tools/oxlint/fixtures/effect-accepted.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"tools/oxlint/fixtures/effect-unrelated-accepted.ts\\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\\"purpose\\\": \\\"unexecuted source inputs read by the actual lint corpus to isolate separate binding/host rules\\\",\\n    \\\"owner\\\": \\\"tools/oxlint/portable-rules.test.ts\\\",\\n    \\\"compiler_boundary\\\": \\\"tools/oxlint/tsconfig.json includes only ./*.ts, outside fixtures directory\\\",\\n    \\\"removal\\\": \\\"retire exact exclusions when their isolated rule fixtures are retired; no workflow host admission\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"recovery\\\": {\\n    \\\"failed_observations\\\": [\\n      \\\"Initial new test object was unsorted, corrected\\\",\\n      \\\"Initial CommonJS corpus used ESM imports and failed the strict diagnostic Schema before rule assertions; replaced with valid CommonJS fixtures\\\",\\n      \\\"Initial corpus extension edit duplicated two expected IDs; corrected before isolated verification\\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\\"rollback\\\": \\\"revert this complete slice to parent revision\\\",\\n6:last_reviewed: 2026-10-04\\n7:review_trigger: rebuild scope, interview answer, version selection, or implementation admission\\n17:This authority includes reviewable commits and draft PRs, but no merge, deploy,\\n89:successful hosted calculation -> API application event owner -> PostHog capture\\n98:Generated clients remain private. Preview uses its own backend. Runtime secrets\\n113:controlled Preview journeys -> exact Website/API artifacts -> independent readback\\n158:request cleanup and are released at their actual host/browser lifetime. Native\\n167:envelopes, unknown procedure tags and request IDs also need qualification;\\n174:checked ingress treatment or an exact reviewed native correction for uncovered\\n198:| Documentation launch | Agreed in Q6: review and publish finished pages | Update and review pages; publish accepted pages and keep unfinished drafts out of public search | Publication records, search, sitemap, Markdown and agent indexes |\\n201:| Functional Effect policy | Required by Cooper's follow-up | Immutable values, declarative workflows, services/Layers and piping across all owned code; current portable rules plus proved corrections for remaining gaps | Mutation/loop restrictions, state ownership and precise host exceptions |\\n221:carry the rebuild through integration, local checks, reviewed provider plans,\\n251:| CSF-002 | Qualify current dependencies and strict repository structure | Root manifest, lock, runtime, exports, TypeScript, formatting, lint, tests, Turbo, Knip and CI select one exact qualified graph. Update canonical repository skill copies and their local profiles together. Enforce 