rees/aac7/taxkit\n//:test:oxlint:task: \n{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"headSha\":\"d9abbb374cec0232636d5eb82696ab1548c6189b\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/actions/runs/37213423930\"}\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"$ turbo run //#test:quality-workflow:task\n\n   • turbo 2.11.7\n   • Packages in scope: //\n   • Running //#test:quality-workflow:task in 1 package\n   • Remote caching disabled, using shared worktree cache\n\n//:test:quality-workflow:task: cache miss, executing 5f14eaf6beacb450\n//:test:quality-workflow:task: $ bun --bun vitest run --config tools/vitest.config.ts tools/quality-workflow\n//:test:quality-workflow:task: \n//:test:quality-workflow:task:  RUN  v5.0.3 /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit\n//:test:quality-workflow:task: \n  Time:    10.043s \n\n$ turbo run //#test:oxlint:task\n\n   • turbo 2.11.7\n   • Packages in scope: //\n   • Running //#test:oxlint:task in 1 package\n   • Remote caching disabled, using shared worktree cache\n\n//:test:oxlint:task: cache miss, executing 7fe4be1f0101955f\n//:test:oxlint:task: $ bun --bun vitest run --config tools/vitest.config.ts tools/oxlint\n//:test:oxlint:task: \n//:test:oxlint:task:  RUN  v5.0.3 /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit\n//:test:oxlint:task: \n{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"headSha\":\"d9abbb374cec0232636d5eb82696ab1548c6189b\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/actions/runs/37213423930\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":843774375},"formatted_output":"$ turbo run //#test:quality-workflow:task\n\n   • turbo 2.11.7\n   • Packages in scope: //\n   • Running //#test:quality-workflow:task in 1 package\n   • Remote caching disabled, using shared worktree cache\n\n//:test:quality-workflow:task: cache miss, executing 5f14eaf6beacb450\n//:test:quality-workflow:task: $ bun --bun vitest run --config tools/vitest.config.ts tools/quality-workflow\n//:test:quality-workflow:task: \n//:test:quality-workflow:task: 