e\\nnode_modules/alchemy/src/Cloudflare/Workers/Worker.ts:449:   * Human-readable annotation attached to the uploaded version, shown in\\nnode_modules/alchemy/src/Cloudflare/Workers/Worker.ts:463: * another Worker's script instead of creating a script of its own.\\nnode_modules/alchemy/src/Cloudflare/Workers/Worker.ts:467: * URLs). A Preview is a named copy with its own variables, secrets,\\nnode_modules/alchemy/src/Cloudflare/Workers/Worker.ts:480:   * When set, this resource does not create a script of its own: it\\nnode_modules/alchemy/src/Cloudflare/Workers/Worker.ts:486:   * *are* allowed: each Preview gets its own isolated namespace.\\nnode_modules/alchemy/src/Cloudflare/Workers/Worker.ts:494:   * (`pr-123`, `feat-login`). Appears in Preview URLs:\\nnode_modules/alchemy/src/Cloudflare/Workers/Worker.ts:506:   * shown in the Cloudflare dashboard.\\nnode_modules/alchemy/src/Cloudflare/Workers/Worker.ts:554:   * instead of creating its own; set `version.traffic` below 100 to\\nnode_modules/alchemy/src/Cloudflare/Workers/Worker.ts:555:   * gradually roll out a deploy of this Worker's own script. For branch\\nnode_modules/alchemy/src/Cloudflare/Workers/Worker.ts:564:   * as a Preview of another Worker's script instead: own URL, bindings,\\nnode_modules/alchemy/src/Cloudflare/Workers/Worker.ts:574:   *   URL and enable version preview URLs.\\nnode_modules/alchemy/src/Cloudflare/Workers/Worker.ts:575:   * - `false` — no `workers.dev` URLs at all.\\nnode_modules/alchemy/src/Cloudflare/Workers/Worker.ts:576:   * - An object — toggle the stable URL and version previews independently,\\nnode_modules/alchemy/src/Cloudflare/Workers/Worker.ts:577:   *   e.g. `{ enabled: false, previewsEnabled: true }` keeps the stable URL\\nnode_modules/alchemy/src/Cloudflare/Workers/Worker.ts:578:   *   off while each deployed version stays reachable at its preview URL.\\nnode_modules/alchemy/src/Cloudflare/Workers/Worker.ts:587:   * owned by this Worker (namespaced under it as `<Worker>/A