{"timestamp":"2026-10-04T16:11:20.399Z","ordinal":14421,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_06b7a884f26959d3016ac27aa020e487d0aa883141086573bc","status":"completed","call_id":"call_PO7g5uS1MtSUzJY03aDOm6iK","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"git push --no-thin -u origin codex/dev-73-foundation-acceptance-review\",sandbox_permissions:\"require_escalated\",justification:\"May I push the tested foundation commit to crcorbett/taxkit for the authorised draft review?\",prefix_rule:[\"git\",\"push\"],yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:2000}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"cat > /private/tmp/taxkit-local-toolchain/foundation-acceptance-pr.md <<'EOF'\\nInline Promise failure mapping previously missed both website apps, infrastructure and some owned source extensions. It now covers all six extensions, with six real-command canaries and unchanged narrow fixture exclusions. Both browser proof adapters map failures inline to their existing closed errors.\\n\\nThe built-Worker proof also intercepted unrelated script assets during its delayed navigation check. It now intercepts only the intended server-function path. Actual browser fixtures load a late asset and cover both screenshot settings; both real built-Worker commands pass after the correction.\\n\\nCurrent service, fact, rule, configuration and package guides match their owning code. Two local skill profiles have refreshed overlay hashes; canonical upstream skills are unchanged. The dated acceptance receipt records the source review, retained failures and T002's completed local criteria. T003 remains next; existing calculator results are retained pending Cooper's separate Medicare decision.\\n\\nValidation: pinned frozen install unchanged (792 installs/1020 packages); 407 actual CLI cases; 397 owned sources pass lint; five guide excerpts compile; root tests pass all 24 tasks, including 54 docs script and 19 server cases; build passes all 15 tasks; full verification passes all 32 Quality cases (13 isolated), both Knip checks, all 24 type tasks, 206 deployment, 21 skill, 16 evaluation, 24 SDK browser and four web browser cases. Final docs, runbooks, formatting and Changeset-status checks pass. Matching caches are identified in the receipt/logs. No new Changeset is needed for private proof scripts, enforcement and maintainer guides.\\n\\nThis is a draft stacked on #126. Local acceptance does not claim this commit's hosted check, review acceptance, merge, deployment, publication or provider changes. External Linear status remains unchanged because automatic approval review blocked the tracking write. Recovery is to revert this complete slice to d9abbb374cec0232636d5eb82696ab1548c6189b.\\nEOF\",max_output_tokens:1000}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1055e-488d-75e2-ab79-097882eda37b","create_time":1791130270.082141}}}
