{"timestamp":"2026-10-04T16:23:07.368Z","ordinal":14731,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_06b7a884f26959d3016ac27d48f4c887d0b4b58fac4dd42334","status":"completed","call_id":"call_T5ZeHGQNuYlvHsuIWbEZKIWd","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nimport json\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\np=Path('docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json');v=json.loads(p.read_text());next(t for t in v['tasks'] if t['id']=='CSF-T003')['status']='in_progress';p.write_text(json.dumps(v,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\np=Path('packages/api/rpc/package.json');v=json.loads(p.read_text());v['devDependencies'].pop('@taxkit/testing',None);v['scripts']['clean']='rm -rf dist .turbo *.tsbuildinfo';p.write_text(json.dumps(v,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\np=Path('knip.json');v=json.loads(p.read_text());v['workspaces']['packages/api/rpc']={'entry':['src/group.ts','src/handlers.ts','src/service.ts','src/server.ts','src/live.layer.ts','src/test.layer.ts','src/schemas.ts','src/errors.ts','src/__testing__/fixtures.ts','test/**/*.test.ts','vitest.config.ts'],'project':['src/**/*.ts','test/**/*.ts','vitest.config.ts']};p.write_text(json.dumps(v,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\np=Path('knip.production.json');v=json.loads(p.read_text());v['workspaces']['packages/api/rpc']={'entry':['src/group.ts!','src/handlers.ts!','src/service.ts!','src/server.ts!','src/live.layer.ts!','src/schemas.ts!','src/errors.ts!'],'project':['src/**/*.ts!','!src/__testing__/**!','!src/test.layer.ts!']};p.write_text(json.dumps(v,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\nPY\\ncat > packages/api/rpc/README.md <<'EOF'\\n---\\ndocument_type: package-readme\\nlifecycle: current\\nauthority: canonical\\nowner: taxkit-api-rpc-owner\\nlast_reviewed: 2026-10-05\\nreview_trigger: RPC contracts, native codecs, clients, handlers, exports or transport proof change\\n---\\n\\n# `@taxkit/api-rpc`\\n\\nPrivate compiled Effect 4 RPC transport over the existing calculator service.\\nIt owns the versioned calculation connection, thin handlers and checked clients.\\nTax definitions and calculation remain with `@taxkit/calculators` and rule\\npackages. This is the first part of T003; the two app hosts are still pending.\\n\\n## Exports\\n\\n- `./group`: native `Calculate` procedure and `TaxKitRpcGroup`.\\n- `./schemas`: calculator-owned request/result and content-owned navigation/path\\n  Schemas, checked API origin, contract version and five-second deadline.\\n- `./errors`: bounded expected, unavailable, invalid-response and deadline errors.\\n- `./handlers`: handler Layer calling `PublicCalculatorService.calculate` once.\\n- `./service`: closed `TaxKitRpcClient.calculate` client contract.\\n- `./server`: native POST `/rpc` Layer with JSON serialisation and checked ingress.\\n- `./live`: caller-scoped native client Layer; the app supplies its HttpClient.\\n- `./test`: explicit test-only in-process client over the same handler.\\n- `./testing/fixtures`: deterministic real-calculator and failure fixtures only.\\n\\nWorkspace source conditions resolve `src`; ordinary imports and declarations\\nresolve `dist`. Build with `bun run --filter=@taxkit/api-rpc build`. This private\\npackage has no public publisher or packed-consumer claim.\\n\\n## Failure and lifetime ownership\\n\\nThe handler projects calculator errors to a fixed reason without reflecting\\nprivate issue paths, causes or messages. Contract version disagreement has its\\nown checked error. The server uses the native JSON parser/encoder and validates\\nits unknown request envelopes before native dispatch. Only bounded request IDs,\\nthe declared procedure, a bounded batch and correctly shaped headers pass.\\nMalformed JSON and request/payload failures use the native global defect path.\\nA supported codec hook replaces that path's encoding with a fixed safe value;\\nthe procedure also declares a safe defect Schema. No message framing is invented.\\n\\nThe private reply codec marks only failures decoding the native calculation exit.\\nBad JSON and invalid result shapes become `CalculatorRpcInvalidResponse`.\\nAn unrelated adapter defect retains its identity; defects remain defects.\\nThe native exit/defect Schema identities and these paths are qualified on\\nEffect 4.0.0, whose RPC APIs remain marked unstable. Requalify on upgrades.\\n\\nA single five-second budget includes headers and complete body decoding. Earlier\\ncaller interruption releases pending body work. Client resources belong to the\\ncaller Layer scope; this package creates no runtime. Public calls provide\\ncredential omission and redirect rejection when the operation runs. The tests\\ncheck that policy at the HttpClient boundary; actual browser enforcement and\\nCORS belong to T003's app-host proof.\\n\\n## Documentation impact\\n\\nThe repository [transport architecture](../../../docs/architecture/api-and-sdk.md),\\n[package ownership](../../../docs/architecture/package-ownership.md),\\n[quality guide](../../../docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md) and active\\n[execution plan](../../../docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md) own the\\nwider design and proof limits. Reusable content operations remain with T005;\\nre-exported content Schemas do not mount authored content in the browser.\\n\\nRun `bun run --filter=@taxkit/api-rpc test`, `check-types` and `build` for focused\\nproof. Root verification also checks source/export direction, actual lint\\npermissions and current documentation.\\n\\n## Runbook applicability\\n\\nNo provider operation is introduced by this package. Repository app/infrastructure\\nrunbooks gain matching-stage host instructions when those hosts are implemented.\\nThis package does not authorise a plan, deployment or secret access.\\n\\n## Non-claims\\n\\nUnit transport proof is not a real Worker, Website, service-binding, browser CORS,\\nprovider, telemetry backend or deployed calculation. The apps are not connected\\nto this package yet. Retained tax results remain unchanged; Medicare correction\\nis a separate unresolved decision. The canonical render receipt records its\\noriginal scaffold and explicit stable-version adaptation; structural validation\\nalone does not prove runtime behaviour.\\nEOF\\ncat > .changeset/native-calculator-rpc.md <<'EOF'\\n---\\n\\\"@taxkit/api-rpc\\\": minor\\n---\\n\\nAdd a private native Effect RPC calculation contract with caller-scoped clients,\\nchecked response failures, a whole-response deadline and safe native request and\\nerror encoding. Calculation remains with the existing calculator service.\\nEOF\\ncat >> docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md <<'EOF'\\n\\n## T003 native RPC contract (in progress)\\n\\nStart T003 from locally accepted foundation commit\\n`5d9e9ab21ed7ce5687cea560c1db3ebe658bd375` ([draft 127](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/127)).\\nIts GitHub Quality run `37215859846` was in progress at creation; this is not\\nhosted acceptance. The new private `packages/api/rpc` is rendered through the\\ncanonical package tool, then adapted to the actual stable Effect 4 exports and\\nTaxKit calculator owners. The template's generic catalogue, RC imports and\\nNDJSON do not describe this bounded POST/JSON calculation contract.\\n\\nThe handler calls `PublicCalculatorService.calculate`; request and result\\nSchemas remain calculator-owned. A checked native-parser ingress prevents\\nunchecked tags/IDs reaching native identity encoding. Per-procedure and global\\nnative defects use fixed safe encoding. The scoped generated client distinguishes\\nexpected failures, unavailable transport, invalid replies and one whole-response\\ndeadline; unrelated adapter defects and earlier interruption retain their\\nclassification. Focused native tests pass the real calculator and failure/body\\npaths; complete slice checks and the two real app hosts remain pending.\\n\\nDocumentation impact: **Change required** for the new package README/exports,\\ntransport/package/quality architecture, exact boundary permissions, Knip entries,\\nlockfile, Changeset, task ledger and dated receipt. **Preserve** calculators,\\npublic HTTP/OpenAPI, existing app and provider wiring, canonical skills,\\nhistorical receipts and retained tax outcomes. Provider runbooks are **N/A** for\\nthis contract-only step because no provider graph or command changes. T003 stays\\nin progress until actual API/Website, binding, origin, browser and lifetime proof\\npasses. No merge, provider operation or publication is authorised.\\nEOF\\nPATH=/private/tmp/taxkit-local-toolchain/bun-darwin-aarch64:$PATH bun install > /private/tmp/taxkit-local-toolchain/dev74-rpc-install.log 2>&1\",sandbox_permissions:\"require_escalated\",justification:\"May I reconcile the private RPC workspace lockfile with its final declared dependencies?\",yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:1000}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1055e-488d-75e2-ab79-097882eda37b","create_time":1791130917.128941}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-04T16:23:07.466Z","ordinal":14732,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a1055e-488d-75e2-ab79-097882eda37b","session_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","root_turn_id":"01a1055e-488d-75e2-ab79-097882eda37b","response_id":"resp_06b7a884f26959d3016ac27d2501b887d0b87c4a1768726ef9","usage":{"input_tokens":199407,"cached_input_tokens":198784,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":2953,"reasoning_output_tokens":1034,"total_tokens":202360},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":283500335,"cached_input_tokens":277936384,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1451790,"reasoning_output_tokens":579129,"total_tokens":284952125},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":283500335,"cached_input_tokens":277936384,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1451790,"reasoning_output_tokens":579129,"total_tokens":284952125}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-04T16:23:11.584Z","ordinal":14733,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a1055e-488d-75e2-ab79-097882eda37b","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-038b1519-246c-40d6-ad0b-69123b971656","process_id":"26939","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json');v=json.loads(p.read_text());next(t for t in v['tasks'] if t['id']=='CSF-T003')['status']='in_progress';p.write_text(json.dumps(v,indent=2)+'\\n')\np=Path('packages/api/rpc/package.json');v=json.loads(p.read_text());v['devDependencies'].pop('@taxkit/testing',None);v['scripts']['clean']='rm -rf dist .turbo *.tsbuildinfo';p.write_text(json.dumps(v,indent=2)+'\\n')\np=Path('knip.json');v=json.loads(p.read_text());v['workspaces']['packages/api/rpc']={'entry':['src/group.ts','src/handlers.ts','src/service.ts','src/server.ts','src/live.layer.ts','src/test.layer.ts','src/schemas.ts','src/errors.ts','src/__testing__/fixtures.ts','test/**/*.test.ts','vitest.config.ts'],'project':['src/**/*.ts','test/**/*.ts','vitest.config.ts']};p.write_text(json.dumps(v,indent=2)+'\\n')\np=Path('knip.production.json');v=json.loads(p.read_text());v['workspaces']['packages/api/rpc']={'entry':['src/group.ts!','src/handlers.ts!','src/service.ts!','src/server.ts!','src/live.layer.ts!','src/schemas.ts!','src/errors.ts!'],'project':['src/**/*.ts!','!src/__testing__/**!','!src/test.layer.ts!']};p.write_text(json.dumps(v,indent=2)+'\\n')\nPY\ncat > packages/api/rpc/README.md <<'EOF'\n---\ndocument_type: package-readme\nlifecycle: current\nauthority: canonical\nowner: taxkit-api-rpc-owner\nlast_reviewed: 2026-10-05\nreview_trigger: RPC contracts, native codecs, clients, handlers, exports or transport proof change\n---\n\n# `@taxkit/api-rpc`\n\nPrivate compiled Effect 4 RPC transport over the existing calculator service.\nIt owns the versioned calculation connection, thin handlers and checked clients.\nTax definitions and calculation remain with `@taxkit/calculators` and rule\npackages. This is the first part of T003; the two app hosts are still pending.\n\n## Exports\n\n- `./group`: native `Calculate` procedure and `TaxKitRpcGroup`.\n- `./schemas`: calculator-owned request/result and content-owned navigation/path\n  Schemas, checked API origin, contract version and five-second deadline.\n- `./errors`: bounded expected, unavailable, invalid-response and deadline errors.\n- `./handlers`: handler Layer calling `PublicCalculatorService.calculate` once.\n- `./service`: closed `TaxKitRpcClient.calculate` client contract.\n- `./server`: native POST `/rpc` Layer with JSON serialisation and checked ingress.\n- `./live`: caller-scoped native client Layer; the app supplies its HttpClient.\n- `./test`: explicit test-only in-process client over the same handler.\n- `./testing/fixtures`: deterministic real-calculator and failure fixtures only.\n\nWorkspace source conditions resolve `src`; ordinary imports and declarations\nresolve `dist`. Build with `bun run --filter=@taxkit/api-rpc build`. This private\npackage has no public publisher or packed-consumer claim.\n\n## Failure and lifetime ownership\n\nThe handler projects calculator errors to a fixed reason without reflecting\nprivate issue paths, causes or messages. Contract version disagreement has its\nown checked error. The server uses the native JSON parser/encoder and validates\nits unknown request envelopes before native dispatch. Only bounded request IDs,\nthe declared procedure, a bounded batch and correctly shaped headers pass.\nMalformed JSON and request/payload failures use the native global defect path.\nA supported codec hook replaces that path's encoding with a fixed safe value;\nthe procedure also declares a safe defect Schema. No message framing is invented.\n\nThe private reply codec marks only failures decoding the native calculation exit.\nBad JSON and invalid result shapes become `CalculatorRpcInvalidResponse`.\nAn unrelated adapter defect retains its identity; defects remain defects.\nThe native exit/defect Schema identities and these paths are qualified on\nEffect 4.0.0, whose RPC APIs remain marked unstable. Requalify on upgrades.\n\nA single five-second budget includes headers and complete body decoding. Earlier\ncaller interruption releases pending body work. Client resources belong to the\ncaller Layer scope; this package creates no runtime. Public calls provide\ncredential omission and redirect rejection when the operation runs. The tests\ncheck that policy at the HttpClient boundary; actual browser enforcement and\nCORS belong to T003's app-host proof.\n\n## Documentation impact\n\nThe repository [transport architecture](../../../docs/architecture/api-and-sdk.md),\n[package ownership](../../../docs/architecture/package-ownership.md),\n[quality guide](../../../docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md) and active\n[execution plan](../../../docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md) own the\nwider design and proof limits. Reusable content operations remain with T005;\nre-exported content Schemas do not mount authored content in the browser.\n\nRun `bun run --filter=@taxkit/api-rpc test`, `check-types` and `build` for focused\nproof. Root verification also checks source/export direction, actual lint\npermissions and current documentation.\n\n## Runbook applicability\n\nNo provider operation is introduced by this package. Repository app/infrastructure\nrunbooks gain matching-stage host instructions when those hosts are implemented.\nThis package does not authorise a plan, deployment or secret access.\n\n## Non-claims\n\nUnit transport proof is not a real Worker, Website, service-binding, browser CORS,\nprovider, telemetry backend or deployed calculation. The apps are not connected\nto this package yet. Retained tax results remain unchanged; Medicare correction\nis a separate unresolved decision. The canonical render receipt records its\noriginal scaffold and explicit stable-version adaptation; structural validation\nalone does not prove runtime behaviour.\nEOF\ncat > .changeset/native-calculator-rpc.md <<'EOF'\n---\n\"@taxkit/api-rpc\": minor\n---\n\nAdd a private native Effect RPC calculation contract with caller-scoped clients,\nchecked response failures, a whole-response deadline and safe native request and\nerror encoding. Calculation remains with the existing calculator service.\nEOF\ncat >> docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md <<'EOF'\n\n## T003 native RPC contract (in progress)\n\nStart T003 from locally accepted foundation commit\n`5d9e9ab21ed7ce5687cea560c1db3ebe658bd375` ([draft 127](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/127)).\nIts GitHub Quality run `37215859846` was in progress at creation; this is not\nhosted acceptance. The new private `packages/api/rpc` is rendered through the\ncanonical package tool, then adapted to the actual stable Effect 4 exports and\nTaxKit calculator owners. The template's generic catalogue, RC imports and\nNDJSON do not describe this bounded POST/JSON calculation contract.\n\nThe handler calls `PublicCalculatorService.calculate`; request and result\nSchemas remain calculator-owned. A checked native-parser ingress prevents\nunchecked tags/IDs reaching native identity encoding. Per-procedure and global\nnative defects use fixed safe encoding. The scoped generated client distinguishes\nexpected failures, unavailable transport, invalid replies and one whole-response\ndeadline; unrelated adapter defects and earlier interruption retain their\nclassification. Focused native tests pass the real calculator and failure/body\npaths; complete slice checks and the two real app hosts remain pending.\n\nDocumentation impact: **Change required** for the new package README/exports,\ntransport/package/quality architecture, exact boundary permissions, Knip entries,\nlockfile, Changeset, task ledger and dated receipt. **Preserve** calculators,\npublic HTTP/OpenAPI, existing app and provider wiring, canonical skills,\nhistorical receipts and retained tax outcomes. Provider runbooks are **N/A** for\nthis contract-only step because no provider graph or command changes. T003 stays\nin progress until actual API/Website, binding, origin, browser and lifetime proof\npasses. No merge, provider operation or publication is authorised.\nEOF\nPATH=/private/tmp/taxkit-local-toolchain/bun-darwin-aarch64:$PATH bun install > /private/tmp/taxkit-local-toolchain/dev74-rpc-install.log 2>&1"],"cwd":"file:///Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json');v=json.loads(p.read_text());next(t for t in v['tasks'] if t['id']=='CSF-T003')['status']='in_progress';p.write_text(json.dumps(v,indent=2)+'\\n')\np=Path('packages/api/rpc/package.json');v=json.loads(p.read_text());v['devDependencies'].pop('@taxkit/testing',None);v['scripts']['clean']='rm -rf dist .turbo *.tsbuildinfo';p.write_text(json.dumps(v,indent=2)+'\\n')\np=Path('knip.json');v=json.loads(p.read_text());v['workspaces']['packages/api/rpc']={'entry':['src/group.ts','src/handlers.ts','src/service.ts','src/server.ts','src/live.layer.ts','src/test.layer.ts','src/schemas.ts','src/errors.ts','src/__testing__/fixtures.ts','test/**/*.test.ts','vitest.config.ts'],'project':['src/**/*.ts','test/**/*.ts','vitest.config.ts']};p.write_text(json.dumps(v,indent=2)+'\\n')\np=Path('knip.production.json');v=json.loads(p.read_text());v['workspaces']['packages/api/rpc']={'entry':['src/group.ts!','src/handlers.ts!','src/service.ts!','src/server.ts!','src/live.layer.ts!','src/schemas.ts!','src/errors.ts!'],'project':['src/**/*.ts!','!src/__testing__/**!','!src/test.layer.ts!']};p.write_text(json.dumps(v,indent=2)+'\\n')\nPY\ncat > packages/api/rpc/README.md <<'EOF'\n---\ndocument_type: package-readme\nlifecycle: current\naut