  \"Structural rendering does not prove installed dependency, declaration, runtime, or packed-consumer behavior.\"\n  ],\n  \"nonClaims\": [\"Selected versions are not claimed to remain latest.\"],\n  \"originalScaffoldConfigDigests\": {\n    \"package.json\": \"529fd22d74c2cadf26524bec9099d8636cbe8b3eef22429977b824197e5e3061\",\n    \"tsconfig.json\": \"71596163cd8ffea16eb4950049bc772ec8a8e2db408759c80bc8232aa40a6d99\",\n    \"tsconfig.build.json\": \"320b70b4115224df6a42038a8759a444d0feecabb0666c22a519904a1e9b9de9\",\n    \"vitest.config.ts\": \"0be6a110349188c59f6651c3e6cc19543b37c18cb1d8b9c4d40666709122798e\"\n  },\n  \"adaptation\": {\n    \"date\": \"2026-10-05\",\n    \"scope\": \"Explicit native stable Effect 4 POST/JSON calculation and checked parser/reply hooks, over existing TaxKit Schemas/services\",\n    \"proof\": \"Focused native compiler, canonical lint and 24 actual native transport/lifetime cases; complete slice checks pending\",\n    \"limitations\": \"Not real app, browser CORS, hosted Worker, service binding, tracing export or provider proof\"\n  }\n}\n{\n  \"document_type\": \"implementation-receipt\",\n  \"date\": \"2026-10-05\",\n  \"task\": \"CSF-T003\",\n  \"issue\": \"DEV-74\",\n  \"status\": \"candidate\",\n  \"parent_revision\": \"5d9e9ab21ed7ce5687cea560c1db3ebe658bd375\",\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"principal\": \"Cooper Corbett\",\n    \"repository\": \"crcorbett/taxkit\",\n    \"operation\": \"local implementation, tested commits, pushes and draft PRs\",\n    \"limit\": \"No merge, deployment, publication, version application or provider operation\"\n  },\n  \"implemented\": [\n    \"Private compiled @taxkit/api-rpc rendered using the canonical package tool and adapted to installed native stable Effect 4 POST/JSON APIs\",\n    \"One versioned Calculate procedure reuses calculator-owned request/result Schemas and delegates once to PublicCalculatorService.calculate\",\n    \"Native JSON parser/encoder retained; checked byte/envelope ingress prevents unsafe tags/IDs reaching native identity encoding; one-MiB UTF-8 parser input, at most 16 requests and 32 bounded header pairs\",\n    \"Supported global defect codec hook bypasses raw defect encoding and returns a fixed value; the per-procedure defect Schema also has a fixed encoding\",\n    \"Private generated client and test-only in-process Layer; no runtime in the package; checked expected/connection/reply/deadline errors, unrelated adapter defect identity and caller interruption preserved\",\n    \"One whole-response five-second deadline includes header and body work; operation provides credential omission/redirect rejection\",\n    \"Actual browser build exposed live modules imported by broad Schema roots; move canonical diagnostics and report/input definitions into narrow public Schema exports, preserving old entrypoints/class identities and retained calculations\"\n  ],\n  \"proof\": [\n    {\n      \"command\": \"native compiler, canonical lint and private package test\",\n      \"outcome\": \"pass: 24 native RPC tests in two files, actual POST/JSON handler/client, real calculator net pay 130100 cents at 165400 cents weekly gross, checked errors, pure/mixed defects, malformed JSON/envelopes/tags/IDs, version skew, invalid replies, exact independent SchemaError defect, deadlines/body/root-scope cleanup and operation policy\",\n      \"logs\": [\n        \"dev74-rpc-tests.log\",\n        \"dev74-rpc-types.log\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"command\": \"bun run build\",\n      \"outcome\": \"pass: all 16 tasks, four matching caches; changed package/dependency builds execute\",\n      \"logs\": [\n        \"dev74-rpc-root-build.log\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"command\": \"SDK packed artifact and clean downstream consumer\",\n      \"outcome\": \"pass: actual packed SDK 46-file import smoke and independent downstream type/runtime/exports/browser bundle; temporary workspaces removed; no adad mutation\",\n      \"logs\": [\n        \"dev74-rpc-packed-sdk.log\",\n        \"dev74-rpc-downstream-sdk.log\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"command\": \"private client browser build and output metadata inspection\",\n      \"outcome\": \"pass: 161118-byte minified browser bundle; no retained live engine/calculator/rule-pack, RPC server, Alchemy, Node/Bun host or authored content modules; core RuleSourcePolicy is a 39-byte Schema definition rather than a live rule\",\n      \"bundle_sha256\": \"dfdb72bf8b14f9b47335df3c34601ce10d0fea7a9fd3db9809ae32b20efb258d\",\n      \"logs\": [\n        \"dev74-rpc-browser-bundle.log\",\n        \"dev74-rpc-client-browser.meta.json\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"documentation_impact\": {\n    \"Change required\": [\n      \"packages/api/rpc/**\",\n      \"packages/core/src/engine/schemas.ts and narrow export/README\",\n      \"packages/rules/au/pay and income-tax canonical calculator Schema modules and narrow exports/READMEs\",\n      \"packages/calculators/src/schemas.ts and README\",\n      \"docs/architecture/api-and-sdk.md\",\n      \"docs/architecture/package-ownership.md\",\n      \"docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md\",\n      \"oxlint.config.ts exact decoder/fixture-encoder/class-factory permissions\",\n      \"knip.json and knip.production.json\",\n      \"bun.lock\",\n      \".changeset/native-calculator-rpc.md\",\n      \"docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json\",\n      \"docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md\",\n      \"docs/documentation-audit/README.md\"\n    ],\n    \"Preserve\": [\n      \"All tax parameters/results and old public Schema/calculator exports\",\n      \"Public HTTP/OpenAPI and current Bun API, web scaffold, docs host and provider graph\",\n      \"Canonical upstream skill trees/digests and host execution permissions\",\n      \"Historical failed/qualified evidence and release train\"\n    ],\n    \"N/A\": {\n      \"provider runbook\": \"This package-only slice changes no provider command or graph; real host operations remain with later T003 composition\",\n      \"generated OpenAPI/public MDX\": \"No HTTP contract or public content changes\",\n      \"private RPC packing\": \"Compiled workspace package has no public publication target; source/default/declaration checks remain local\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"limitations\": [\n    \"Candidate acceptance awaits complete slice checks; T003 remains in progress\",\n    \"Actual app Worker/Website, matching-stage binding/own origin, real browser CORS/navigation/unmount and full trace-field/export qualification remain pending\",\n    \"Captured native reply/log sentinels do not qualify exported traces or provider telemetry; per-procedure/global replies are qualified on the selected version only\",\n    \"Parser byte limits prevent parsing oversized input; native request-reader limits belong to the incoming app host and are not yet qualified\",\n    \"Browser bundle proof covers the private client, not a production Website artifact\",\n    \"Companion adad qualification remains exactly 59b0a36ff1bc6f95501734ee65d789a4f5a37fcc; no later SDK qualification there\",\n    \"Linear tracking mutation remains blocked by automatic approval review pending the existing exact user question\"\n  ],\n  \"recovery\": {\n    \"failed_observations\": [\n      \"Canonical renderer first rejected an incomplete version snapshot; no target was created until the existing qualified graph and template-adaptation limit were recorded\",\n      \"An automated lint suggestion incorrectly added new to a Schema class factory; native compiler/tests rejected it, the constructor was restored and exact class-factory spelling admission added\",\n      \"The first log fixture blocked waiting for an empty Queue; closing/collecting the owned observation queue after native server scope cleanup fixes the fixture without extending its deadline\",\n      \"Typed fixture construction required owning branded constructors, and operation policy observation uses serviceOption to preserve the native HttpClient requirement\",\n      \"Initial client bundle retained live engine/rule-pack imports through broad Schema exports; narrow canonical owners remove them\"\n    ],\n    \"rollback\": \"Revert the complete slice to the parent commit and restore its frozen dependency graph\"\n  },\n  \"previous_hosted_check\": {\n    \"workflow_run\": 37215859846,\n    \"head\": \"5d9e9ab21ed7ce5687cea560c1db3ebe658bd375\",\n    \"conclusion\": \"success\",\n    \"limit\": \"Foundation draft #127 only; not this uncommitted T003 work\"\n  },\n  \"non_claims\": [\n    \"No completed T003 task or connected calculator app\",\n    \"No Medicare correction\",\n    \"No provider readback, apply, hosted new Worker or publication\"\n  ]\n}\n## T003 native RPC contract (in progress)\n\nStart T003 from locally accepted foundation commit\n`5d9e9ab21ed7ce5687cea560c1db3ebe658bd375` ([draft 127](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/127)).\nIts GitHub Quality run `37215859846` was in progress at creation; this is not\nhosted acceptance. The new private `packages/api/rpc` is rendered through the\ncanonical package tool, then adapted to the actual stable Effect 4 exports and\nTaxKit calculator owners. The template's generic catalogue, RC imports and\nNDJSON do not describe this bounded POST/JSON calculation contract.\n\nThe handler calls `PublicCalculatorService.calculate`; request and result\nSchemas remain calculator-owned. A checked native-parser ingress prevents\nunchecked tags/IDs reaching native identity encoding. Per-procedure and global\nnative defects use fixed safe encoding. The scoped generated client distinguishes\nexpected failures, unavailable transport, invalid replies and one whole-response\ndeadline; unrelated adapter defects and earlier interruption retain their\nclassification. Focused native tests pass the real calculator and failure/body\npaths; complete slice checks and the two real app hosts remain pending.\n\nDocumentation impact: **Change required** for the new package README/exports,\ntransport/package/quality architecture, exact boundary permissions, Knip entries,\nlockfile, Changeset, task ledger and dated receipt. **Preserve** calculators,\npublic HTTP/OpenAPI, existing app and provider wiring, canonical skills,\nhistorical receipts and retained tax outcomes. Provider runbooks are **N/A** for\nthis contract-only step because no provider graph or command changes. T003 stays\nin progress until actual API/Website, binding, origin, browser and lifetime proof\npasses. No merge, provider operation or publication is authorised.\n\nA subsequent readback confirms GitHub Quality `37215859846` passed the exact\nfoundation commit `5d9e9ab21ed7ce5687cea560c1db3ebe658bd375`. It does not qualify\nthis new T003 candidate. The [RPC receipt](../../documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-05-native-rpc-contract.json)\nrecords 24 native cases, the observed broad-Schema browser import correction,\nlocal package/SDK proof and remaining app-host requirements.\n# Package contract\n\n## Ownership before files\n\nName the capability, its callers, its untrusted boundaries, its runtime owner,\nand why an existing package cannot own it. A package is justified by a stable\nsemantic boundary, not by file count.\n\nCompiled packages use `tsc -p tsconfig.build.json`, relative internal imports\nwith explicit `.js` endings, and explicit exports. Use the same endings in\ntests; TypeScript and the source consumer resolve them to the matching `.ts`\nfiles, while ordinary ESM consumers load the emitted `.js` files. Root exports\nare absent by default; an intentional root\nmust remain contract-only. The source condition maps to `src`, `types` to\ndeclarations, and `default` to `dist`. `publishConfig.exports` omits the source\ncondition. Source-only packages point both development/default resolution at\nsource and explain the bundler requirement in their package README.\n\nRequired Effect service paths:\n\n```text\nsrc/schemas.ts\nsrc/errors.ts\nsrc/service.ts\nsrc/live.layer.ts\nsrc/test.layer.ts\nsrc/__testing__/fixtures.ts\nsrc/__testing__/observations.ts\ntest/service.test.ts\n```\n\nUse `mock.layer.ts` only when its semantics are distinct from the deterministic\ntest Layer. Tests live under `test/`; `src/__testing__` contains reusable setup,\nfixtures, and observations only.\n\nEach package README names the semantic owner, public/live/test export paths,\ndownstream architecture/proof impact, runbook applicability, and explicit\nnon-claims. Repository profiles—not this global contract—name exact local\ncommands and document paths.\n\n## Separate source, domain and transport owners\n\nAuthored content may live in a source-only package. It exports files and source\ninventory; the domain package owns the validation Schemas and source loader,\nservice, named errors and live/test Layers. Apps supply bundler/host adapters.\nDo not give the source package another runtime or duplicate domain definitions.\nHTTP, RPC and MCP reuse explicit domain exports. Client exports must resolve\nwithout importing handlers, the live source loader, renderer or MCP server.\nCheck the actual browser bundle as well as the export map.\n\n## Export proof\n\nConsumer fixtures must prove all four modes:\n\n1. repository source condition resolves source;\n2. TypeScript resolves emitted declarations;\n3. default resolution uses built JavaScript;\n4. packed/publish exports omit source-only paths and conditions.\n\nNever rely only on checking that export keys exist.\n\n`publishConfig.exports` is not a portable manifest rewrite: npm and Bun pack may\nretain the development `exports` map, while other package managers may apply the\npublish map. A publishable package therefore needs the repository's explicit\nstaged-manifest/prepack path and tarball inspection. Prove the actual publisher\nused by that repository; do not infer a clean tarball from `publishConfig`.\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"name\": \"@taxkit/api-rpc\",\n  \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"exports\": {\n    \"./group\": {\n      \"source\": \"./src/group.ts\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/group.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./dist/group.js\"\n    },\n    \"./handlers\": {\n      \"source\": \"./src/handlers.ts\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/handlers.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./dist/handlers.js\"\n    },\n    \"./service\": {\n      \"source\": \"./src/service.ts\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/service.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./dist/service.js\"\n    },\n    \"./server\": {\n      \"source\": \"./src/server.ts\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/server.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./dist/server.js\"\n    },\n    \"./live\": {\n      \"source\": \"./src/live.layer.ts\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/live.layer.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./dist/live.layer.js\"\n    },\n    \"./test\": {\n      \"source\": \"./src/test.layer.ts\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/test.layer.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./dist/test.layer.js\"\n    },\n    \"./schemas\": {\n      \"source\": \"./src/schemas.ts\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/schemas.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./dist/schemas.js\"\n    },\n    \"./errors\": {\n      \"source\": \"./src/errors.ts\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/errors.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./dist/errors.js\"\n    },\n    \"./testing/fixtures\": {\n      \"source\": \"./src/__testing__/fixtures.ts\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/__testing__/fixtures.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./dist/__testing__/fixtures.js\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"publishConfig\": {\n    \"exports\": {\n      \"./group\": {\n        \"types\": \"./dist/group.d.ts\",\n        \"default\": \"./dist/group.js\"\n      },\n      \"./service\": {\n        \"types\": \"./dist/service.d.ts\",\n        \"default\": \"./dist/service.js\"\n      },\n      \"./server\": {\n        \"types\": \"./dist/server.d.ts\",\n        \"default\": \"./dist/server.js\"\n      },\n      \"./live\": {\n        \"types\": \"./dist/live.layer.d.ts\",\n        \"default\": \"./dist/live.layer.js\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"rm -rf dist && tsc -p tsconfig.build.json\",\n    \"check-types\": \"tsc --noEmit\",\n    \"test\": \"bun --bun vitest run\",\n    \"clean\": \"rm -rf dist .turbo *.tsbuildinfo\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@taxkit/calculators\": \"workspace:*\",\n    \"@taxkit/docs-content\": \"workspace:*\",\n    \"effect\": \"catalog:\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@effect/vitest\": \"catalog:\",\n    \"@taxkit/core\": \"workspace:*\",\n    \"@taxkit/rules-au-pay\": \"workspace:*\",\n    \"typescript\": \"catalog:\",\n    \"vite\": \"catalog:\",\n    \"vitest\": \"catalog:\"\n  }\n}\n{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\n  \"kind\": \"rpc\",\n  \"packageName\": \"@taxkit/api-rpc\",\n  \"domainPackage\": \"@taxkit/calculators\",\n  \"sourceCondition\": \"source\",\n  \"versionSnapshot\": {\n    \"resolvedAt\": \"2026-10-05\",\n    \"sha256\": \"2938a67efef3b517b5ac520871b39b92027ce10258d62f8c6fd11b94d20988aa\"\n  },\n  \"officialSources\": {\n    \"effect\": \"https://github.com/Effect-TS/effect\",\n    \"typescript\": \"https://github.com/microsoft/typescript-go\"\n  },\n  \"selectedVersions\": {\n    \"effect\": \"4.0.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"7.0.2\",\n    \"vitest\": \"5.0.3\"\n  },\n  \"compatibilityDecisions\": [\n    {\n      \"status\": \"qualified\",\n      \"decision\": \"Use TaxKit installed stable Effect 4.0.0 and native TypeScript 7.0.2, rather than canonical templates rc.117 snapshot\",\n      \"evidence\": \"docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-05-foundation-acceptance-review.json\",\n      \"limitation\": \"RPC templates still require adaptation and runtime qualification before acceptance\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"configDigests\": {\n    \"package.json\": \"8d9c28ace1a255d4e78aa318a702c18f1b1563a43e98b2805c6216f07e281ba0\",\n    \"tsconfig.json\": \"d6ff2031891c11e64e335f72ba07787615e93b4ef1e6eb54f07be29b34edd1f9\",\n    \"tsconfig.build.json\": \"044f58d619deef8e2416a1fce0a3418879aac27f2aa5d70b245a4c774acac230\",\n    \"vitest.config.ts\": \"c81a2a24fc321eaa98816ca4b8e42bd601c6406b7bd48d3e8a5bd450dcc2faeb\"\n  },\n  \"limitations\": [\n    \"Structural rendering does not prove installed dependency, declaration, runtime, or packed-consumer behavior.\"\n  ],\n  \"nonClaims\": [\"Selected versions are not claimed to remain latest.\"],\n  \"originalScaffoldConfigDigests\": {\n    \"package.json\": \"529fd22d74c2cadf26524bec9099d8636cbe8b3eef22429977b824197e5e3061\",\n    \"tsconfig.json\": \"71596163cd8ffea16eb4950049bc772ec8a8e2db408759c80bc8232aa40a6d99\",\n    \"tsconfig.build.json\": \"320b70b4115224df6a42038a8759a444d0feecabb0666c22a519904a1e9b9de9\",\n    \"vitest.config.ts\": \"0be6a110349188c59f6651c3e6cc19543b37c18cb1d8b9c4d40666709122798e\"\n  },\n  \"adaptation\": {\n    \"date\": \"2026-10-05\",\n    \"scope\": \"Explicit native stable Effect 4 POST/JSON calculation and checked parser/reply hooks, over existing TaxKit Schemas/services\",\n    \"proof\": \"Focused native compiler, canonical lint and 24 actual native transport/lifetime cases; complete slice checks pending\",\n    \"limitations\": \"Not real app, browser CORS, hosted Worker, service binding, tracing export or provider proof\"\n  }\n}\n{\n  \"document_type\": \"implementation-receipt\",\n  \"date\": \"2026-10-05\",\n  \"task\": \"CSF-T003\",\n  \"issue\": \"DEV-74\",\n  \"status\": \"candidate\",\n  \"parent_revision\": \"5d9e9ab21ed7ce5687cea560c1db3ebe658bd375\",\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"principal\": \"Cooper Corbett\",\n    \"repository\": \"crcorbett/taxkit\",\n    \"operation\": \"local implementation, tested commits, pushes and draft PRs\",\n    \"limit\": \"No merge, deployment, publication, version application or provider operation\"\n  },\n  \"implemented\": [\n    \"Private compiled @taxkit/api-rpc rendered using the canonical package tool and adapted to installed native stable Effect 4 POST/JSON APIs\",\n    \"One versioned Calculate procedure reuses calculator-owned request/result Schemas and delegates once to PublicCalculatorService.calculate\",\n    \"Native JSON parser/encoder retained; checked byte/envelope ingress prevents unsafe tags/IDs reaching native identity encoding; one-MiB UTF-8 parser input, at most 16 requests and 32 bounded header pairs\",\n    \"Supported global defect codec hook bypasses raw defect encoding and returns a fixed value; the per-procedure defect Schema also has a fixed encoding\",\n    \"Private generated client and test-only in-process Layer; no runtime in the package; checked expected/connection/reply/deadline errors, unrelated adapter defect identity and caller interruption preserved\",\n    \"One whole-response five-second deadline includes header and body work; operation provides credential omission/redirect rejection\",\n    \"Actual browser build exposed live modules imported by broad Schema roots; move canonical diagnostics and report/input definitions into narrow public Schema exports, preserving old entrypoints/class identities and retained calculations\"\n  ],\n  \"proof\": [\n    {\n      \"command\": \"native compiler, canonical lint and private package test\",\n      \"outcome\": \"pass: 24 native RPC tests in two files, actual POST/JSON handler/client, real calculator net pay 130100 cents at 165400 cents weekly gross, checked errors, pure/mixed defects, malformed JSON/envelopes/tags/IDs, version skew, invalid replies, exact independent SchemaError defect, deadlines/body/root-scope cleanup and operation policy\",\n      \"logs\": [\n        \"dev74-rpc-tests.log\",\n        \"dev74-rpc-types.log\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"command\": \"bun run build\",\n      \"outcome\": \"pass: all 16 tasks, four matching caches; changed package/dependency builds execute\",\n      \"logs\": [\n        \"dev74-rpc-root-build.log\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"command\": \"SDK packed artifact and clean downstream consumer\",\n      \"outcome\": \"pass: actual packed SDK 46-file import smoke and independent downstream type/runtime/exports/browser bundle; temporary workspaces removed; no adad mutation\",\n      \"logs\": [\n        \"dev74-rpc-packed-sdk.log\",\n        \"dev74-rpc-downstream-sdk.log\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"command\": \"private client browser build and output metadata inspection\",\n      \"outcome\": \"pass: 161118-byte minified browser bundle; no retained live engine/calculator/rule-pack, RPC server, Alchemy, Node/Bun host or authored content modules; core RuleSourcePolicy is a 39-byte Schema definition rather than a live rule\",\n      \"bundle_sha256\": \"dfdb72bf8b14f9b47335df3c34601ce10d0fea7a9fd3db9809ae32b20efb258d\",\n      \"logs\": [\n        \"dev74-rpc-browser-bundle.log\",\n        \"dev74-rpc-client-browser.meta.json\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"documentation_impact\": {\n    \"Change required\": [\n      \"packages/api/rpc/**\",\n      \"packages/core/src/engine/schemas.ts and narrow export/README\",\n      \"packages/rules/au/pay and income-tax canonical calculator Schema modules and narrow exports/READMEs\",\n      \"packages/calculators/src/schemas.ts and README\",\n      \"docs/architecture/api-and-sdk.md\",\n      \"docs/architecture/package-ownership.md\",\n      \"docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md\",\n      \"oxlint.config.ts exact decoder/fixture-encoder/class-factory permissions\",\n      \"knip.json and knip.production.json\",\n      \"bun.lock\",\n      \".changeset/native-calculator-rpc.md\",\n      \"docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json\",\n      \"docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md\",\n      \"docs/documentation-audit/README.md\"\n    ],\n    \"Preserve\": [\n      \"All tax parameters/results and old public Schema/calculator exports\",\n      \"Public HTTP/OpenAPI and current Bun API, web scaffold, docs host and provider graph\",\n      \"Canonical upstream skill trees/digests and host execution permissions\",\n      \"Historical failed/qualified evidence and release train\"\n    ],\n    \"N/A\": {\n      \"provider runbook\": \"This package-only slice changes no provider command or graph; real host operations remain with later T003 composition\",\n      \"generated OpenAPI/public MDX\": \"No HTTP contract or public content changes\",\n      \"private RPC packing\": \"Compiled workspace package has no public publication target; source/default/declaration checks remain local\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"limitations\": [\n    \"Candidate acceptance awaits complete slice checks; T003 remains in progress\",\n    \"Actual app Worker/Website, matching-stage binding/own origin, real browser CORS/navigation/unmount and full trace-field/export qualification remain pending\",\n    \"Captured native reply/log sentinels do not qualify exported traces or provider telemetry; per-procedure/global replies are qualified on the selected version only\",\n    \"Parser byte limits prevent parsing oversized input; native request-reader limits belong to the incoming app host and are not yet qualified\",\n    \"Browser bundle proof covers the private client, not a production Website artifact\",\n    \"Companion adad qualification remains exactly 59b0a36ff1bc6f95501734ee65d789a4f5a37fcc; no later SDK qualification there\",\n    \"Linear tracking mutation remains blocked by automatic approval review pending the existing exact user question\"\n  ],\n  \"recovery\": {\n    \"failed_observations\": [\n      \"Canonical renderer first rejected an incomplete version snapshot; no target was created until the existing qualified graph and template-adaptation limit were recorded\",\n      \"An automated lint suggestion incorrectly added new to a Schema class factory; native compiler/tests rejected it, the constructor was restored and exact class-factory spelling admission added\",\n      \"The first log fixture blocked waiting for an empty Queue; closing/collecting the owned observation queue after native server scope cleanup fixes the fixture without extending its deadline\",\n      \"Typed fixture construction required owning branded constructors, and operation policy observation uses serviceOption to preserve the native HttpClient requirement\",\n      \"Initial client bundle retained live engine/rule-pack imports through broad Schema exports; narrow canonical owners remove them\"\n    ],\n    \"rollback\": \"Revert the complete slice to the parent commit and restore its frozen dependency graph\"\n  },\n  \"previous_hosted_check\": {\n    \"workflow_run\": 37215859846,\n    \"head\": \"5d9e9ab21ed7ce5687cea560c1db3ebe658bd375\",\n    \"conclusion\": \"success\",\n    \"limit\": \"Foundation draft #127 only; not this uncommitted T003 work\"\n  },\n  \"non_claims\": [\n    \"No completed T003 task or connected calculator app\",\n    \"No Medicare correction\",\n    \"No provider readback, apply, hosted new Worker or publication\"\n  ]\n}\n## T003 native RPC contract (in progress)\n\nStart T003 from locally accepted foundation commit\n`5d9e9ab21ed7ce5687cea560c1db3ebe658bd375` ([draft 127](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/127)).\nIts GitHub Quality run `37215859846` was in progress at creation; this is not\nhosted acceptance. The new private `packages/api/rpc` is rendered through the\ncanonical package tool, then adapted to the actual stable Effect 4 exports and\nTaxKit calculator owners. The template's generic catalogue, RC imports and\nNDJSON do not describe this bounded POST/JSON calculation contract.\n\nThe handler calls `PublicCalculatorService.calculate`; request and result\nSchemas remain calculator-owned. A checked native-parser ingress prevents\nunchecked tags/IDs reaching native identity encoding. Per-procedure and global\nnative defects use fixed safe encoding. The scoped generated client distinguishes\nexpected failures, unavailable transport, invalid replies and one whole-response\ndeadline; unrelated adapter defects and earlier interruption retain their\nclassification. Focused native tests pass the real calculator and failure/body\npaths; complete slice checks and the two real app hosts remain pending.\n\nDocumentation impact: **Change required** for the new package README/exports,\ntransport/package/quality architecture, exact boundary permissions, Knip entries,\nlockfile, Changeset, task ledger and dated receipt. **Preserve** calculators,\npublic HTTP/OpenAPI, existing app and provider wiring, canonical skills,\nhistorical receipts and retained tax outcomes. Provider runbooks are **N/A** for\nthis contract-only step because no provider graph or command changes. T003 stays\nin progress until actual API/Website, binding, origin, browser and lifetime proof\npasses. No merge, provider operation or publication is authorised.\n\nA subsequent readback confirms GitHub Quality `37215859846` passed the exact\nfoundation commit `5d9e9ab21ed7ce5687cea560c1db3ebe658bd375`. It does not qualify\nthis new T003 candidate. The [RPC receipt](../../documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-05-native-rpc-contract.json)\nrecords 24 native cases, the observed broad-Schema browser import correction,\nlocal package/SDK proof and remaining app-host requirements.\n# Package contract\n\n## Ownership before files\n\nName the capability, its callers, its untrusted boundaries, its runtime owner,\nand why an existing package cannot own it. A package is justified by a stable\nsemantic boundary, not by file count.\n\nCompiled packages use `tsc -p tsconfig.build.json`, relative internal imports\nwith explicit `.js` endings, and explicit exports. Use the same endings in\ntests; TypeScript and the source consumer resolve them to the matching `.ts`\nfiles, while ordinary ESM consumers load the emitted `.js` files. Root exports\nare absent by default; an intentional root\nmust remain contract-only. The source condition maps to `src`, `types` to\ndeclarations, and `default` to `dist`. `publishConfig.exports` omits the source\ncondition. Source-only packages point both development/default resolution at\nsource and explain the bundler requirement in their package README.\n\nRequired Effect service paths:\n\n```text\nsrc/schemas.ts\nsrc/errors.ts\nsrc/service.ts\nsrc/live.layer.ts\nsrc/test.layer.ts\nsrc/__testing__/fixtures.ts\nsrc/__testing__/observations.ts\ntest/service.test.ts\n```\n\nUse `mock.layer.ts` only when its semantics are distinct from the deterministic\ntest Layer. Tests live under `test/`; `src/__testing__` contains reusable setup,\nfixtures, and observations only.\n\nEach package README names the semantic owner, public/live/test export paths,\ndownstream architecture/proof impact, runbook applicability, and explicit\nnon-claims. Repository profiles—not this global contract—name exact local\ncommands and document paths.\n\n## Separate source, domain and transport owners\n\nAuthored content may live in a source-only package. It exports files and source\ninventory; the domain package owns the validation Schemas and source loader,\nservice, named errors and live/test Layers. Apps supply bundler/host adapters.\nDo not give the source package another runtime or duplicate domain definitions.\nHTTP, RPC and MCP reuse explicit domain exports. Client exports must resolve\nwithout importing handlers, the live source loader, renderer or MCP server.\nCheck the actual browser bundle as well as the export map.\n\n## Export proof\n\nConsumer fixtures must prove all four modes:\n\n1. repository source condition resolves source;\n2. TypeScript resolves emitted declarations;\n3. default resolution uses built JavaScript;\n4. packed/publish exports omit source-only paths and conditions.\n\nNever rely only on checking that export keys exist.\n\n`publishConfig.exports` is not a portable manifest rewrite: npm and Bun pack may\nretain the development `exports` map, while other package managers may apply the\npublish map. A publishable package therefore needs the repository's explicit\nstaged-manifest/prepack path and tarball inspection. Prove the actual publisher\nused by that repository; do not infer a clean tarball from `publishConfig`.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":6458},"formatted_output":"{\n  \"name\": \"@taxkit/api-rpc\",\n  \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"exports\": {\n    \"./group\": {\n      \"source\": \"./src/group.ts\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/group.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./dist/group.js\"\n    },\n    \"./handlers\": {\n      \"source\": \"./src/handlers.ts\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/handlers.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./dist/handlers.js\"\n    },\n    \"./service\": {\n      \"source\": \"./src/service.ts\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/service.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./dist/service.js\"\n    },\n    \"./server\": {\n      \"source\": \"./src/server.ts\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/server.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./dist/server.js\"\n    },\n    \"./live\": {\n      \"source\": \"./src/live.layer.ts\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/live.layer.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./dist/live.layer.js\"\n    },\n    \"./test\": {\n      \"source\": \"./src/test.layer.ts\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/test.layer.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./dist/test.layer.js\"\n    },\n    \"./schemas\": {\n      \"source\": \"./src/schemas.ts\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/schemas.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./dist/schemas.js\"\n    },\n    \"./errors\": {\n      \"source\": \"./src/errors.ts\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/errors.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./dist/errors.js\"\n    },\n    \"./testing/fixtures\": {\n      \"source\": \"./src/__testing__/fixtures.ts\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/__testing__/fixtures.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./dist/__testing__/fixtures.js\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"publishConfig\": {\n    \"exports\": {\n      \"./group\": {\n        \"types\": \"./dist/group.d.ts\",\n        \"default\": \"./dist/group.js\"\n      },\n      \"./service\": {\n        \"types\": \"./dist/service.d.ts\",\n        \"default\": \"./dist/service.js\"\n      },\n      \"./server\": {\n        \"types\": \"./dist/server.d.ts\",\n        \"default\": \"./dist/server.js\"\n      },\n      \"./live\": {\n        \"types\": \"./dist/live.layer.d.ts\",\n        \"default\": \"./dist/live.layer.js\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"rm -rf dist && tsc -p tsconfig.build.json\",\n    \"check-types\": \"tsc --noEmit\",\n    \"test\": \"bun --bun vitest run\",\n    \"clean\": \"rm -rf dist .turbo *.tsbuildinfo\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@taxkit/calculators\": \"workspace:*\",\n    \"@taxkit/docs-content\": \"workspace:*\",\n    \"effect\": \"catalog:\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@effect/vitest\": \"catalog:\",\n    \"@taxkit/core\": \"workspace:*\",\n    \"@taxkit/rules-au-pay\": \"workspace:*\",\n    \"typescript\": \"catalog:\",\n    \"vite\": \"catalog:\",\n    \"vitest\": \"catalog:\"\n  }\n}\n{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\n  \"kind\": \"rpc\",\n  \"packageName\": \"@taxkit/api-rpc\",\n  \"domainPackage\": \"@taxkit/calculators\",\n  \"sourceCondition\": \"source\",\n  \"versionSnapshot\": {\n    \"resolvedAt\": \"2026-10-05\",\n    \"sha256\": \"2938a67efef3b517b5ac520871b39b92027ce10258d62f8c6fd11b94d20988aa\"\n  },\n  \"officialSources\": {\n    \"effect\": \"https://github.com/Effect-TS/effect\",\n    \"typescript\": \"https://github.com/microsoft/typescript-go\"\n  },\n  \"selectedVersions\": {\n    \"effect\": \"4.0.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"7.0.2\",\n    \"vitest\": \"5.0.3\"\n  },\n  \"compatibilityDecisions\": [\n    {\n      \"status\": \"qualified\",\n      \"decision\": \"Use TaxKit installed stable Effect 4.0.0 and native TypeScript 7.0.2, rather than canonical templates rc.117 snapshot\",\n      \"evidence\": \"docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-05-foundation-acceptance-review.json\",\n      \"limitation\": \"RPC templates still require adaptation and runtime qualification before acceptance\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"configDigests\": {\n    \"package.json\": \"8d9c28ace1a255d4e78aa318a702c18f1b1563a43e98b2805c6216f07e281ba0\",\n    \"tsconfig.json\": \"d6ff2031891c11e64e335f72ba07787615e93b4ef1e6eb54f07be29b34edd1f9\",\n    \"tsconfig.build.json\": \"044f58d619deef8e2416a1fce0a3418879aac27f2aa5d70b245a4c774acac230\",\n    \"vitest.config.ts\": \"c81a2a24fc321eaa98816ca4b8e42bd601c6406b7bd48d3e8a5bd450dcc2faeb\"\n  },\n  \"limitations\": [\n    \"Structural rendering does not prove installed dependency, declaration, runtime, or packed-consumer behavior.\"\n  ],\n  \"nonClaims\": [\"Selected versions are not claimed to remain latest.\"],\n  \"originalScaffoldConfigDigests\": {\n    \"package.json\": \"529fd22d74c2cadf26524bec9099d8636cbe8b3eef22429977b824197e5e3061\",\n    \"tsconfig.json\": \"71596163cd8ffea16eb4950049bc772ec8a8e2db408759c80bc8232aa40a6d99\",\n    \"tsconfig.build.json\": \"320b70b4115224df6a42038a8759a444d0feecabb0666c22a519904a1e9b9de9\",\n    \"vitest.config.ts\": \"0be6a110349188c59f6651c3e6cc19543b37c18cb1d8b9c4d40666709122798e\"\n  },\n  \"adaptation\": {\n    \"date\": \"2026-10-05\",\n    \"scope\": \"Explicit native stable Effect 4 POST/JSON calculation and checked parser/reply hooks, over existing TaxKit Schemas/services\",\n    \"proof\": \"Focused native compiler, canonical lint and 24 actual native transport/lifetime cases; complete slice checks pending\",\n    \"limitations\": \"Not real app, browser CORS, hosted Worker, service binding, tracing export or provider proof\"\n  }\n}\n{\n  \"document_type\": \"implementation-receipt\",\n  \"date\": \"2026-10-05\",\n  \"task\": \"CSF-T003\",\n  \"issue\": \"DEV-74\",\n  \"status\": \"candidate\",\n  \"parent_revision\": \"5d9e9ab21ed7ce5687cea560c1db3ebe658bd375\",\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"principal\": \"Cooper Corbett\",\n    \"repository\": \"crcorbett/taxkit\",\n    \"operation\": \"local implementation, tested commits, pushes and draft PRs\",\n    \"limit\": \"No merge, deployment, publication, version application or provider operation\"\n  },\n  \"implemented\": [\n    \"Private compiled @taxkit/api-rpc rendered using the canonical package tool and adapted to installed native stable Effect 4 POST/JSON APIs\",\n    \"One versioned Calculate procedure reuses calculator-owned request/result Schemas and delegates once to PublicCalculatorService.calculate\",\n    \"Native JSON parser/encoder retained; checked byte/envelope ingress prevents unsafe tags/IDs reaching native identity encoding; one-MiB UTF-8 parser input, at most 16 requests and 32 bounded header pairs\",\n    \"Supported global defect codec hook bypasses raw defect encoding and returns a fixed value; the per-procedure defect Schema also has a fixed encoding\",\n    \"Private generated client and test-only in-process Layer; no runtime in the package; checked expected/connection/reply/deadline errors, unrelated adapter defect identity and caller interruption preserved\",\n    \"One whole-response five-second deadline includes header and body work; operation provides credential omission/redirect rejection\",\n    \"Actual browser build exposed live modules imported by broad Schema roots; move canonical diagnostics and report/input definitions into narrow public Schema exports, preserving old entrypoints/class identities and retained calculations\"\n  ],\n  \"proof\": [\n    {\n      \"command\": \"native compiler, canonical lint and private package test\",\n      \"outcome\": \"pass: 24 native RPC tests in two files, actual POST/JSON handler/client, real calculator net pay 130100 cents at 165400 cents weekly gross, checked errors, pure/mixed defects, malformed JSON/envelopes/tags/IDs, version skew, invalid replies, exact independent SchemaError defect, deadlines/body/root-scope cleanup and operation policy\",\n      \"logs\": [\n        \"dev74-rpc-tests.log\",\n        \"dev74-rpc-types.log\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"command\": \"bun run build\",\n      \"outcome\": \"pass: all 16 tasks, four matching caches; changed package/dependency builds execute\",\n      \"logs\": [\n        \"dev74-rpc-root-build.log\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"command\": \"SDK packed artifact and clean downstream consumer\",\n      \"outcome\": \"pass: actual packed SDK 46-file import smoke and independent downstream type/runtime/exports/browser bundle; temporary workspaces removed; no adad mutation\",\n      \"logs\": [\n        \"dev74-rpc-packed-sdk.log\",\n        \"dev74-rpc-downstream-sdk.log\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"command\": \"private client browser build and output metadata inspection\",\n      \"outcome\": \"pass: 161118-byte minified browser bundle; no retained live engine/calculator/rule-pack, RPC server, Alchemy, Node/Bun host or authored content modules; core RuleSourcePolicy is a 39-byte Schema definition rather than a live rule\",\n      \"bundle_sha256\": \"dfdb72bf8b14f9b47335df3c34601ce10d0fea7a9fd3db9809ae32b20efb258d\",\n      \"logs\": [\n        \"dev74-rpc-browser-bundle.log\",\n        \"dev74-rpc-client-browser.meta.json\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"documentation_impact\": {\n    \"Change required\": [\n      \"packages/api/rpc/**\",\n      \"packages/core/src/engine/schemas.ts and narrow export/README\",\n      \"packages/rules/au/pay and income-tax canonical calculator Schema modules and narrow exports/READMEs\",\n      \"packages/calculators/src/schemas.ts and README\",\n      \"docs/architecture/api-and-sdk.md\",\n      \"docs/architecture/package-ownership.md\",\n      \"docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md\",\n      \"oxlint.config.ts exact decoder/fixture-encoder/class-factory permissions\",\n      \"knip.json and knip.production.json\",\n      \"bun.lock\",\n      \".changeset/native-calculator-rpc.md\",\n      \"docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json\",\n      \"docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md\",\n      \"docs/documentation-audit/README.md\"\n    ],\n    \"Preserve\": [\n      \"All tax parameters/results and old public Schema/calculator exports\",\n      \"Public HTTP/OpenAPI and current Bun API, web scaffold, docs host and provider graph\",\n      \"Canonical upstream skill trees/digests and host execution permissions\",\n      \"Historical failed/qualified evidence and release train\"\n    ],\n    \"N/A\": {\n      \"provider runbook\": \"This package-only slice changes no provider command or graph; real host operations remain with later T003 composition\",\n      \"generated OpenAPI/public MDX\": \"No HTTP contract or public content changes\",\n      \"private RPC packing\": \"Compiled workspace package has no public publication target; source/default/declaration checks remain local\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"limitations\": [\n    \"Candidate acceptance awaits complete slice checks; T003 remains in progress\",\n    \"Actual app Worker/Website, matching-stage binding/own origin, real browser CORS/navigation/unmount and full trace-field/export qualification remain pending\",\n    \"Captured native reply/log sentinels do not qualify exported traces or provider telemetry; per-procedure/global replies are qualified on the selected version only\",\n    \"Parser byte limits prevent parsing oversized input; native request-reader limits belong to the incoming app host and are not yet qualified\",\n    \"Browser bundle proof covers the private client, not a production Website artifact\",\n    \"Companion adad qualification remains exactly 59b0a36ff1bc6f95501734ee65d789a4f5a37fcc; no later SDK qualification there\",\n    \"Linear tracking mutation remains blocked by automatic approval review pending the existing exact user question\"\n  ],\n  \"recovery\": {\n    \"failed_observations\": [\n      \"Canonical renderer first rejected an incomplete version snapshot; no target was created until the existing qualified graph and template-adaptation limit were recorded\",\n      \"An automated lint suggestion incorrectly added new to a Schema class factory; native compiler/tests rejected it, the constructor was restored and exact class-factory spelling admission added\",\n      \"The first log fixture blocked waiting for an empty Queue; closing/collecting the owned observation queue after native server scope cleanup fixes the fixture without extending its deadline\",\n      \"Typed fixture construction required owning branded constructors, and operation policy observation uses serviceOption to preserve the native HttpClient requirement\",\n      \"Initial client bundle retained live engine/rule-pack imports through broad Schema exports; narrow canonical owners remove them\"\n    ],\n    \"rollback\": \"Revert the complete slice to the parent commit and restore its frozen dependency graph\"\n  },\n  \"previous_hosted_check\": {\n    \"workflow_run\": 37215859846,\n    \"head\": \"5d9e9ab21ed7ce5687cea560c1db3ebe658bd375\",\n    \"conclusion\": \"success\",\n    \"limit\": \"Foundation draft #127 only; not this uncommitted T003 work\"\n  },\n  \"non_claims\": [\n    \"No completed T003 task or connected calculator app\",\n    \"No Medicare correction\",\n    \"No provider readback, apply, hosted new Worker or publication\"\n  ]\n}\n## T003 native RPC contract (in progress)\n\nStart T003 from locally accepted foundation commit\n`5d9e9ab21ed7ce5687cea560c1db3ebe658bd375` ([draft 127](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/127)).\nIts GitHub Quality run `37215859846` was in progress at creation; this is not\nhosted acceptance. The new private `packages/api/rpc` is rendered through the\ncanonical package tool, then adapted to the actual stable Effect 4 exports and\nTaxKit calculator owners. The template's generic catalogue, RC imports and\nNDJSON do not describe this bounded POST/JSON calculation contract.\n\nThe handler calls `PublicCalculatorService.calculate`; request and result\nSchemas remain calculator-owned. A checked native-parser ingress prevents\nunchecked tags/IDs reaching native identity encoding. Per-procedure and global\nnative defects use fixed safe encoding. The scoped generated client distinguishes\nexpected failures, unavailable transport, invalid replies and one whole-response\ndeadline; unrelated adapter defects and earlier interruption retain their\nclassification. Focused native tests pass the real calculator and failure/body\npaths; complete slice checks and the two real app hosts remain pending.\n\nDocumentation impact: **Change required** for the new package README/exports,\ntransport/package/quality architecture, exact boundary permissions, Knip entries,\nlockfile, Changeset, task ledger and dated receipt. **Preserve** calculators,\npublic HTTP/OpenAPI, existing app and provider wiring, canonical skills,\nhistorical receipts and retained tax outcomes. Provider runbooks are **N/A** for\nthis contract-only step because no provider graph or command changes. T003 stays\nin progress until actual API/Website, binding, origin, browser and lifetime proof\npasses. No merge, provider operation or publication is authorised.\n\nA subsequent readback confirms GitHub Quality `37215859846` passed the exact\nfoundation commit `5d9e9ab21ed7ce5687cea560c1db3ebe658bd375`. It does not qualify\nthis new T003 candidate. The [RPC receipt](../../documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-05-native-rpc-contract.json)\nrecords 24 native cases, the observed broad-Schema browser import correction,\nlocal package/SDK proof and remaining app-host requirements.\n# Package contract\n\n## Ownership before files\n\nName the capability, its callers, its untrusted boundaries, its runtime owner,\nand why an existing package cannot own it. A package is justified by a stable\nsemantic boundary, not by file count.\n\nCompiled packages use `tsc -p tsconfig.build.json`, relative internal imports\nwith explicit `.js` endings, and explicit exports. Use the same endings in\ntests; TypeScript and the source consumer resolve them to the matching `.ts`\nfiles, while ordinary ESM consumers load the emitted `.js` files. Root exports\nare absent by default; an intentional root\nmust remain contract-only. The source condition maps to `src`, `types` to\ndeclarations, and `default` to `dist`. `publishConfig.exports` omits the source\ncondition. Source-only packages point both development/default resolution at\nsource and explain the bundler requirement in their package README.\n\nRequired Effect service paths:\n\n```text\nsrc/schemas.ts\nsrc/errors.ts\nsrc/service.ts\nsrc/live.layer.ts\nsrc/test.layer.ts\nsrc/__testing__/fixtures.ts\nsrc/__testing__/observations.ts\ntest/service.test.ts\n```\n\nUse `mock.layer.ts` only when its semantics are distinct from the deterministic\ntest Layer. Tests live under `test/`; `src/__testing__` contains reusable setup,\nfixtures, and observations only.\n\nEach package README names the semantic owner, public/live/test export paths,\ndownstream architecture/proof impact, runbook applicability, and explicit\nnon-claims. Repository profiles—not this global contract—name exact local\ncommands and document paths.\n\n## Separate source, domain and transport owners\n\nAuthored content may live in a source-only package. It exports files and source\ninventory; the domain package owns the validation Schemas and source loader,\nservice, named errors and live/test Layers. Apps supply bundler/host adapters.\nDo not give the source package another runtime or duplicate domain definitions.\nHTTP, RPC and MCP reuse explicit domain exports. Client exports must resolve\nwithout importing handlers, the live source loader, renderer or MCP server.\nCheck the actual browser bundle as well as the export map.\n\n## Export proof\n\nConsumer fixtures must prove all four modes:\n\n1. repository source condition resolves source;\n2. TypeScript resolves emitted declarations;\n3. default resolution uses built JavaScript;\n4. packed/publish exports omit source-only paths and conditions.\n\nNever rely only on checking that export keys exist.\n\n`publishConfig.exports` is not a portable manifest rewrite: npm and Bun pack may\nretain the development `exports` map, while other package managers may apply the\npublish map. A publishable package therefore needs the repository's explicit\nstaged-manifest/prepack path and tarball inspection. Prove the actual publisher\nused by that repository; do not infer a clean tarball from `publishConfig`.\n"},"started_at_ms":1791131804463,"completed_at_ms":1791131804463}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-04T16:36:45.541Z","ordinal":14965,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a107c6-6765-7643-97c7-2795a4524950","call_id":"call_PUfAGULpd0o4pjwl9VX05dBf","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 1.2 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":0,\"result\":{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"b6e44a\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000006458,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":4308,\"output\":\"{\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"@taxkit/api-rpc\\\",\\n  \\\"version\\\": \\\"0.1.0\\\",\\n  \\\"private\\\": true,\\n  \\\"type\\\": \\\"module\\\",\\n  \\\"exports\\\": {\\n    \\\"./group\\\": {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"./src/group.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"types\\\": \\\"./dist/group.d.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"default\\\": \\\"./dist/group.js\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"./handlers\\\": {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"./src/handlers.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"types\\\": \\\"./dist/handlers.d.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"default\\\": \\\"./dist/handlers.js\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"./service\\\": {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"./src/service.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"types\\\": \\\"./dist/service.d.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"default\\\": \\\"./dist/service.js\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"./server\\\": {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"./src/server.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"types\\\": \\\"./dist/server.d.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"default\\\": \\\"./dist/server.js\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"./live\\\": {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"./src/live.layer.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"types\\\": \\\"./dist/live.layer.d.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"default\\\": \\\"./dist/live.layer.js\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"./test\\\": {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"./src/test.layer.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"types\\\": \\\"./dist/test.layer.d.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"default\\\": \\\"./dist/test.layer.js\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"./schemas\\\": {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"./src/schemas.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"types\\\": \\\"./dist/schemas.d.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"default\\\": \\\"./dist/schemas.js\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"./errors\\\": {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"./src/errors.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"types\\\": \\\"./dist/errors.d.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"default\\\": \\\"./dist/errors.js\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"./testing/fixtures\\\": {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"./src/__testing__/fixtures.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"types\\\": \\\"./dist/__testing__/fixtures.d.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"default\\\": \\\"./dist/__testing__/fixtures.js\\\"\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\\"publishConfig\\\": {\\n    \\\"exports\\\": {\\n      \\\"./group\\\": {\\n        \\\"types\\\": \\\"./dist/group.d.ts\\\",\\n        \\\"default\\\": \\\"./dist/group.js\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"./service\\\": {\\n        \\\"types\\\": \\\"./dist/service.d.ts\\\",\\n        \\\"default\\\": \\\"./dist/service.js\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"./server\\\": {\\n        \\\"types\\\": \\\"./dist/server.d.ts\\\",\\n        \\\"default\\\": \\\"./dist/server.js\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"./live\\\": {\\n        \\\"types\\\": \\\"./dist/live.layer.d.ts\\\",\\n        \\\"default\\\": \\\"./dist/live.layer.js\\\"\\n      }\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\\"scripts\\\": {\\n    \\\"build\\\": \\\"rm -rf dist && tsc -p tsconfig.build.json\\\",\\n    \\\"check-types\\\": \\\"tsc --noEmit\\\",\\n    \\\"test\\\": \\\"bun --bun vitest run\\\",\\n    \\\"clean\\\": \\\"rm -rf dist .turbo *.tsbuildinfo\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"dependencies\\\": {\\n    \\\"@taxkit/calculators\\\": \\\"workspace:*\\\",\\n    \\\"@taxkit/docs-content\\\": \\\"workspace:*\\\",\\n    \\\"effect\\\": \\\"catalog:\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"devDependencies\\\": {\\n    \\\"@effect/vitest\\\": \\\"catalog:\\\",\\n    \\\"@taxkit/core\\\": \\\"workspace:*\\\",\\n    \\\"@taxkit/rules-au-pay\\\": \\\"workspace:*\\\",\\n    \\\"typescript\\\": \\\"catalog:\\\",\\n    \\\"vite\\\": \\\"catalog:\\\",\\n    \\\"vitest\\\": \\\"catalog:\\\"\\n  }\\n}\\n{\\n  \\\"schemaVersion\\\": 1,\\n  \\\"kind\\\": \\\"rpc\\\",\\n  \\\"packageName\\\": \\\"@taxkit/api-rpc\\\",\\n  \\\"domainPackage\\\": \\\"@taxkit/calculators\\\",\\n  \\\"sourceCondition\\\": \\\"source\\\",\\n  \\\"versionSnapshot\\\": {\\n    \\\"resolvedAt\\\": \\\"2026-10-05\\\",\\n    \\\"sha256\\\": \\\"2938a67efef3b517b5ac520871b39b92027ce10258d62f8c6fd11b94d20988aa\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"officialSources\\\": {\\n    \\\"effect\\\": \\\"https://github.com/Effect-TS/effect\\\",\\n    \\\"typescript\\\": \\\"https://github.com/microsoft/typescript-go\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"selectedVersions\\\": {\\n    \\\"effect\\\": \\\"4.0.0\\\",\\n    \\\"typescript\\\": \\\"7.0.2\\\",\\n    \\\"vitest\\\": \\\"5.0.3\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"compatibilityDecisions\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"qualified\\\",\\n      \\\"decision\\\": \\\"Use TaxKit installed stable Effect 4.0.0 and native TypeScript 7.0.2, rather than canonical templates rc.117 snapshot\\\",\\n      \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-05-foundation-acceptance-review.json\\\",\\n      \\\"limitation\\\": \\\"RPC templates still require adaptation and runtime qualification before acceptance\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"configDigests\\\": {\\n    \\\"package.json\\\": \\\"8d9c28ace1a255d4e78aa318a702c18f1b1563a43e98b2805c6216f07e281ba0\\\",\\n    \\\"tsconfig.json\\\": \\\"d6ff2031891c11e64e335f72ba07787615e93b4ef1e6eb54f07be29b34edd1f9\\\",\\n    \\\"tsconfig.build.json\\\": \\\"044f58d619deef8e2416a1fce0a3418879aac27f2aa5d70b245a4c774acac230\\\",\\n    \\\"vitest.config.ts\\\": \\\"c81a2a24fc321eaa98816ca4b8e42bd601c6406b7bd48d3e8a5bd450dcc2faeb\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"limitations\\\": [\\n    \\\"Structural rendering does not prove installed dependency, declaration, runtime, or packed-consumer behavior.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"nonClaims\\\": [\\\"Selected versions are not claimed to remain latest.\\\"],\\n  \\\"originalScaffoldConfigDigests\\\": {\\n    \\\"package.json\\\": \\\"529fd22d74c2cadf26524bec9099d8636cbe8b3eef22429977b824197e5e3061\\\",\\n    \\\"tsconfig.json\\\": \\\"71596163cd8ffea16eb4950049bc772ec8a8e2db408759c80bc8232aa40a6d99\\\",\\n    \\\"tsconfig.build.json\\\": \\\"320b70b4115224df6a42038a8759a444d0feecabb0666c22a519904a1e9b9de9\\\",\\n    \\\"vitest.config.ts\\\": \\\"0be6a110349188c59f6651c3e6cc19543b37c18cb1d8b9c4d40666709122798e\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"adaptation\\\": {\\n    \\\"date\\\": \\\"2026-10-05\\\",\\n    \\\"scope\\\": \\\"Explicit native stable Effect 4 POST/JSON calculation and checked parser/reply hooks, over existing TaxKit Schemas/services\\\",\\n    \\\"proof\\\": \\\"Focused native compiler, canonical lint and 24 actual native transport/lifetime cases; complete slice checks pending\\\",\\n    \\\"limitations\\\": \\\"Not real app, browser CORS, hosted Worker, service binding, tracing export or provider proof\\\"\\n  }\\n}\\n{\\n  \\\"document_type\\\": \\\"implementation-receipt\\\",\\n  \\\"date\\\": \\\"2026-10-05\\\",\\n  \\\"task\\\": \\\"CSF-T003\\\",\\n  \\\"issue\\\": \\\"DEV-74\\\",\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"candidate\\\",\\n  \\\"parent_revision\\\": \\\"5d9e9ab21ed7ce5687cea560c1db3ebe658bd375\\\",\\n  \\\"authority\\\": {\\n    \\\"principal\\\": \\\"Cooper Corbett\\\",\\n    \\\"repository\\\": \\\"crcorbett/taxkit\\\",\\n    \\\"operation\\\": \\\"local implementation, tested commits, pushes and draft PRs\\\",\\n    \\\"limit\\\": \\\"No merge, deployment, publication, version application or provider operation\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"implemented\\\": [\\n    \\\"Private compiled @taxkit/api-rpc rendered using the canonical package tool and adapted to installed native stable Effect 4 POST/JSON APIs\\\",\\n    \\\"One versioned Calculate procedure reuses calculator-owned request/result Schemas and delegates once to PublicCalculatorService.calculate\\\",\\n    \\\"Native JSON parser/encoder retained; checked byte/envelope ingress prevents unsafe tags/IDs reaching native identity encoding; one-MiB UTF-8 parser input, at most 16 requests and 32 bounded header pairs\\\",\\n    \\\"Supported global defect codec hook bypasses raw defect encoding and returns a fixed value; the per-procedure defect Schema also has a fixed encoding\\\",\\n    \\\"Private generated client and test-only in-process Layer; no runtime in the package; checked expected/connection/reply/deadline errors, unrelated adapter defect identity and caller interruption preserved\\\",\\n    \\\"One whole-response five-second deadline includes header and body work; operation provides credential omission/redirect rejection\\\",\\n    \\\"Actual browser build exposed live modules imported by broad Schema roots; move canonical diagnostics and report/input definitions into narrow public Schema exports, preserving old entrypoints/class identities and retained calculations\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"proof\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"native compiler, canonical lint and private package test\\\",\\n      \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"pass: 24 native RPC tests in two files, actual POST/JSON handler/client, real calculator net pay 130100 cents at 165400 cents weekly gross, checked errors, pure/mixed defects, malformed JSON/envelopes/tags/IDs, version skew, invalid replies, exact independent SchemaError defect, deadlines/body/root-scope cleanup and operation policy\\\",\\n      \\\"logs\\\": [\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-tests.log\\\",\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-types.log\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"bun run build\\\",\\n      \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"pass: all 16 tasks, four matching caches; changed package/dependency builds execute\\\",\\n      \\\"logs\\\": [\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-root-build.log\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"SDK packed artifact and clean downstream consumer\\\",\\n      \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"pass: actual packed SDK 46-file import smoke and independent downstream type/runtime/exports/browser bundle; temporary workspaces removed; no adad mutation\\\",\\n      \\\"logs\\\": [\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-packed-sdk.log\\\",\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-downstream-sdk.log\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"private client browser build and output metadata inspection\\\",\\n      \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"pass: 161118-byte minified browser bundle; no retained live engine/calculator/rule-pack, RPC server, Alchemy, Node/Bun host or authored content modules; core RuleSourcePolicy is a 39-byte Schema definition rather than a live rule\\\",\\n      \\\"bundle_sha256\\\": \\\"dfdb72bf8b14f9b47335df3c34601ce10d0fea7a9fd3db9809ae32b20efb258d\\\",\\n      \\\"logs\\\": [\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-browser-bundle.log\\\",\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-client-browser.meta.json\\\"\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"documentation_impact\\\": {\\n    \\\"Change required\\\": [\\n      \\\"packages/api/rpc/**\\\",\\n      \\\"packages/core/src/engine/schemas.ts and narrow export/README\\\",\\n      \\\"packages/rules/au/pay and income-tax canonical calculator Schema modules and narrow exports/READMEs\\\",\\n      \\\"packages/calculators/src/schemas.ts and README\\\",\\n      \\\"docs/architecture/api-and-sdk.md\\\",\\n      \\\"docs/architecture/package-ownership.md\\\",\\n      \\\"docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md\\\",\\n      \\\"oxlint.config.ts exact decoder/fixture-encoder/class-factory permissions\\\",\\n      \\\"knip.json and knip.production.json\\\",\\n      \\\"bun.lock\\\",\\n      \\\".changeset/native-calculator-rpc.md\\\",\\n      \\\"docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json\\\",\\n      \\\"docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md\\\",\\n      \\\"docs/documentation-audit/README.md\\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\\"Preserve\\\": [\\n      \\\"All tax parameters/results and old public Schema/calculator exports\\\",\\n      \\\"Public HTTP/OpenAPI and current Bun API, web scaffold, docs host and provider graph\\\",\\n      \\\"Canonical upstream skill trees/digests and host execution permissions\\\",\\n      \\\"Historical failed/qualified evidence and release train\\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\\"N/A\\\": {\\n      \\\"provider runbook\\\": \\\"This package-only slice changes no provider command or graph; real host operations remain with later T003 composition\\\",\\n      \\\"generated OpenAPI/public MDX\\\": \\\"No HTTP contract or public content changes\\\",\\n      \\\"private RPC packing\\\": \\\"Compiled workspace package has no public publication target; source/default/declaration checks remain local\\\"\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\\"limitations\\\": [\\n    \\\"Candidate acceptance awaits complete slice checks; T003 remains in progress\\\",\\n    \\\"Actual app Worker/Website, matching-stage binding/own origin, real browser CORS/navigation/unmount and full trace-field/export qualification remain pending\\\",\\n    \\\"Captured native reply/log sentinels do not qualify exported traces or provider telemetry; per-procedure/global replies are qualified on the selected version only\\\",\\n    \\\"Parser byte limits prevent parsing oversized input; native request-reader limits belong to the incoming app host and are not yet qualified\\\",\\n    \\\"Browser bundle proof covers the private client, not a production Website artifact\\\",\\n    \\\"Companion adad qualification remains exactly 59b0a36ff1bc6f95501734ee65d789a4f5a37fcc; no later SDK qualification there\\\",\\n    \\\"Linear tracking mutation remains blocked by automatic approval review pending the existing exact user question\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"recovery\\\": {\\n    \\\"failed_observations\\\": [\\n      \\\"Canonical renderer first rejected an incomplete version snapshot; no target was created until the existing qualified graph and template-adaptation limit were recorded\\\",\\n      \\\"An automated lint suggestion incorrectly added new to a Schema class factory; native compiler/tests rejected it, the constructor was restored and exact class-factory spelling admission added\\\",\\n      \\\"The first log fixture blocked waiting for an empty Queue; closing/collecting the owned observation queue after native server scope cleanup fixes the fixture without extending its deadline\\\",\\n      \\\"Typed fixture construction required owning branded constructors, and operation policy observation uses serviceOption to preserve the native HttpClient requirement\\\",\\n      \\\"Initial client bundle retained live engine/rule-pack imports through broad Schema exports; narrow canonical owners remove them\\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\\"rollback\\\": \\\"Revert the complete slice to the parent commit and restore its frozen dependency graph\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"previous_hosted_check\\\": {\\n    \\\"workflow_run\\\": 37215859846,\\n    \\\"head\\\": \\\"5d9e9ab21ed7ce5687cea560c1db3ebe658bd375\\\",\\n    \\\"conclusion\\\": \\\"success\\\",\\n    \\\"limit\\\": \\\"Foundation draft #127 only; not this uncommitted T003 work\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"non_claims\\\": [\\n    \\\"No completed T003 task or connected calculator app\\\",\\n    \\\"No Medicare correction\\\",\\n    \\\"No provider readback, apply, hosted new Worker or publication\\\"\\n  ]\\n}\\n## T003 native RPC contract (in progress)\\n\\nStart T003 from locally accepted foundation commit\\n`5d9e9ab21ed7ce5687cea560c1db3ebe658bd375` ([draft 127](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/127)).\\nIts GitHub Quality run `37215859846` was in progress at creation; this is not\\nhosted acceptance. The new private `packages/api/rpc` is rendered through the\\ncanonical package tool, then adapted to the actual stable Effect 4 exports and\\nTaxKit calculator owners. The template's generic catalogue, RC imports and\\nNDJSON do not describe this bounded POST/JSON calculation contract.\\n\\nThe handler calls `PublicCalculatorService.calculate`; request and result\\nSchemas remain calculator-owned. A checked native-parser ingress prevents\\nunchecked tags/IDs reaching native identity encoding. Per-procedure and global\\nnative defects use fixed safe encoding. The scoped generated client distinguishes\\nexpected failures, unavailable transport, invalid replies and one whole-response\\ndeadline; unrelated adapter defects and earlier interruption retain their\\nclassification. Focused native tests pass the real calculator and failure/body\\npaths; complete slice checks and the two real app hosts remain pending.\\n\\nDocumentation impact: **Change required** for the new package README/exports,\\ntransport/package/quality architecture, exact boundary permissions, Knip entries,\\nlockfile, Changeset, task ledger and dated receipt. **Preserve** calculators,\\npublic HTTP/OpenAPI, existing app and provider wiring, canonical skills,\\nhistorical receipts and retained tax outcomes. Provider runbooks are **N/A** for\\nthis contract-only step because no provider graph or command changes. T003 stays\\nin progress until actual API/Website, binding, origin, browser and lifetime proof\\npasses. No merge, provider operation or publication is authorised.\\n\\nA subsequent readback confirms GitHub Quality `37215859846` passed the exact\\nfoundation commit `5d9e9ab21ed7ce5687cea560c1db3ebe658bd375`. It does not qualify\\nthis new T003 candidate. The [RPC receipt](../../documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-05-native-rpc-contract.json)\\nrecords 24 native cases, the observed broad-Schema browser import correction,\\nlocal package/SDK proof and remaining app-host requirements.\\n# Package contract\\n\\n## Ownership before files\\n\\nName the capability, its callers, its untrusted boundaries, its runtime owner,\\nand why an existing package cannot own it. A package is justified by a stable\\nsemantic boundary, not by file count.\\n\\nCompiled packages use `tsc -p tsconfig.build.json`, relative internal imports\\nwith explicit `.js` endings, and explicit exports. Use the same endings in\\ntests; TypeScript and the source consumer resolve them to the matching `.ts`\\nfiles, while ordinary ESM consumers load the emitted `.js` files. Root exports\\nare absent by default; an intentional root\\nmust remain contract-only. The source condition maps to `src`, `types` to\\ndeclarations, and `default` to `dist`. `publishConfig.exports` omits the source\\ncondition. Source-only packages point both development/default resolution at\\nsource and explain the bundler requirement in their package README.\\n\\nRequired Effect service paths:\\n\\n```text\\nsrc/schemas.ts\\nsrc/errors.ts\\nsrc/service.ts\\nsrc/live.layer.ts\\nsrc/test.layer.ts\\nsrc/__testing__/fixtures.ts\\nsrc/__testing__/observations.ts\\ntest/service.test.ts\\n```\\n\\nUse `mock.layer.ts` only when its semantics are distinct from the deterministic\\ntest Layer. Tests live under `test/`; `src/__testing__` contains reusable setup,\\nfixtures, and observations only.\\n\\nEach package README names the semantic owner, public/live/test export paths,\\ndownstream architecture/proof impact, runbook applicability, and explicit\\nnon-claims. Repository profiles—not this global contract—name exact local\\ncommands and document paths.\\n\\n## Separate source, domain and transport owners\\n\\nAuthored content may live in a source-only package. It exports files and source\\ninventory; the domain package owns the validation Schemas and source loader,\\nservice, named errors and live/test Layers. Apps supply bundler/host adapters.\\nDo not give the source package another runtime or duplicate domain definitions.\\nHTTP, RPC and MCP reuse explicit domain exports. Client exports must resolve\\nwithout importing handlers, the live source loader, renderer or MCP server.\\nCheck the actual browser bundle as well as the export map.\\n\\n## Export proof\\n\\nConsumer fixtures must prove all four modes:\\n\\n1. repository source condition resolves source;\\n2. TypeScript resolves emitted declarations;\\n3. default resolution uses built JavaScript;\\n4. packed/publish exports omit source-only paths and conditions.\\n\\nNever rely only on checking that export keys exist.\\n\\n`publishConfig.exports` is not a portable manifest rewrite: npm and Bun pack may\\nretain the development `exports` map, while other package managers may apply the\\npublish map. A publishable package therefore needs the repository's explicit\\nstaged-manifest/prepack path and tarball inspection. Prove the actual publisher\\nused by that repository; do not infer a clean tarball from `publishConfig`.\\n\"}}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":1,\"result\":{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"539cfe\",\"wall_time_seconds\":1.001957292,\"session_id\":50764,\"original_token_count\":0,\"output\":\"\"}}}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1055e-488d-75e2-ab79-097882eda37b","create_time":1791131805.541254}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
