DNS for a Preview.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:612:        \"Declare adopted retained Production zone/settings and native taxkit.dev Website plus www redirect and api.taxkit.dev backend domain attachments; keep Preview away from Production DNS. Derive each host's own origin from native Cloudflare.Worker.URL and cross-host addresses from native resource Outputs, with application-ingress Schema checks and checked failure for absent Outputs. Qualify local, Preview and custom-domain behaviour; domains are infrastructure inputs, not duplicated application-origin configuration.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:622:      \"implementationPrompt\": \"Read the proposed/accepted SPEC and its current/target/test call graphs before editing. Implement only this named slice after final shared understanding and its task prerequisites are settled. Use immutable canonical Schema-derived values, brands/errors/Config, closed named services, separate live/test Layers and application-owned execution. Keep lazy flat Effects and pipes where linear data flow is clearer; no local mutation, imperative loops, helper sprawl or generic callbacks. Necessary changing state has an explicit React/Effect owner and pure updates. Exact host exceptions admit only their required construct. Change owning docs, READMEs, exports, enforcement and operational pointers in the same slice. Report any design mismatch and update the SPEC/tasks before acceptance. Use bounded independent factual research/review only where authorised and justified.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:642:        \"basis\": \"Primary owner reviews the diff, named outcomes, focused and complete checks, applicable real journeys, source evidence and affected owner/pointer changes.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:646:        \"The reviewed plan names exact resources/account/stage and never creates or edits Production DNS for a Preview.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:668:        \"Manage retained TaxKit Production and shared Preview projects through a private Alchemy Resource/Provider and current Distilled PostHog, with checked organisation/region/ownership and safe management failures.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:670:        \"Use a synchronous final-enrichment allowlist, memory-only persistence, explicit DNT and disabled automatic/replay/person features. Local and ordinary Preview capture stay off; no consent dialog.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:679:      \"implementationPrompt\": \"Read the proposed/accepted SPEC and its current/target/test call graphs before editing. Implement only this named slice after final shared understanding and its task prerequisites are settled. Use immutable canonical Schema-derived values, brands/errors/Config, closed named services, separate live/test Layers and application-owned execution. Keep lazy flat Effects and pipes where linear data flow is clearer; no local mutation, imperative loops, helper sprawl or generic callbacks. Necessary changing state has an explicit React/Effect owner and pure updates. Exact host exceptions admit only their required construct. Change owning docs, READMEs, exports, enforcement and operational pointers in the same slice. Report any design mismatch and update the SPEC/tasks before acceptance. Use bounded independent factual research/review only where authorised and justified.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:693:        \"Check denied storage, DNT before/after acquisition, ordinary Preview/development off, cleanup and relay size/deadline/status/redirect failures.\"\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:703:        \"basis\": \"Primary owner reviews the diff, named outcomes, focused and complete checks, applicable real journeys, source evidence and affected owner/pointer changes.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:709:        \"An event delivery response is transport proof only; exact provider UUID readback remains a separately authorised Preview journey.\"\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:729:        \"Reference Site's three retained dataset outputs from CooperCorbettSiteCloudflare/prod, never declare/adopt/change them; provision only TaxKit-owned retained ingest token, destination and dashboards under a reviewed plan.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:732:        \"Prove a closed safe field policy across application and automatic traces. Qualify URL-field suppression or the candidate safe-native-span fallback on the exact version, including inbound/outbound spans, Axiom and retained Cloudflare storage. If privacy cannot be met, keep that path disabled, record CSF-009 as unmet and resolve a reviewed design change; do not claim safe native spans survived or silently add a competing exporter.\"\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:737:        \"Signal/privacy/cleanup tests, filtered dashboard/query definitions and controlled Preview readback procedures\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:740:      \"implementationPrompt\": \"Read the proposed/accepted SPEC and its current/target/test call graphs before editing. Implement only this named slice after final shared understanding and its task prerequisites are settled. Use immutable canonical Schema-derived values, brands/errors/Config, closed named services, separate live/test Layers and application-owned execution. Keep lazy flat Effects and pipes where linear data flow is clearer; no local mutation, imperative loops, helper sprawl or generic callbacks. Necessary changing state has an explicit React/Effect owner and pure updates. Exact host exceptions admit only their required construct. Change owning docs, READMEs, exports, enforcement and operational pointers in the same slice. Report any design mismatch and update the SPEC/tasks before acceptance. Use bounded independent factual research/review only where authorised and justified.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:764:        \"basis\": \"Primary owner reviews the diff, named outcomes, focused and complete checks, applicable real journeys, source evidence and affected owner/pointer changes.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:770:        \"No privacy claim is accepted on application allowlisting alone; provider indexing is separately proved for an authorised Preview.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:771:        \"Required safe tracing has actual capability evidence. Disabling unsafe traces is containment, not completion of the requested tracing requirement; unresolved native privacy constraints need a reviewed design change.\"\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:802:        \"Update current journey inventory for each calculator path, docs/discovery, SDK consumer, remote/browser agents and analytics/telemetry privacy. Obtain one fresh independent review and reconcile material findings.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:803:        \"Run complete local checks and deliver a concrete version-matched provider plan for final approval. Once separately authorised, apply controlled Preview, read back exact artifacts/events/signals/domains and teardown safely before a separately approved Production cutover.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:809:        \"Dated bounded closeout/Preview/Production receipts only for operations actually performed\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:812:      \"implementationPrompt\": \"Read the proposed/accepted SPEC and its current/target/test call graphs before editing. Implement only this named slice after final shared understanding and its task prerequisites are settled. Use immutable canonical Schema-derived values, brands/errors/Config, closed named services, separate live/test Layers and application-owned execution. Keep lazy flat Effects and pipes where linear data flow is clearer; no local mutation, imperative loops, helper sprawl or generic callbacks. Necessary changing state has an explicit React/Effect owner and pure updates. Exact host exceptions admit only their required construct. Change owning docs, READMEs, exports, enforcement and operational pointers in the same slice. Report any design mismatch and update the SPEC/tasks before acceptance. Use bounded independent factual research/review only where authorised and justified.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:833:        \"After explicit provider authority, verify exact Preview artifact identity and independent PostHog/Axiom readback; verify DNS/TLS/canonical www/API behaviour after any approved domain apply.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:844:        \"basis\": \"Primary owner reviews the diff, named outcomes, focused and complete checks, applicable real journeys, source evidence and affected owner/pointer changes.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:849:        \"Provider/release claims have exact authority and independent boundary readback; unexecuted operations remain explicitly unproved.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:850:        \"The user receives the reviewable implementation and proof limits; local success is never presented as Production success.\"\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:6:last_reviewed: 2026-10-04\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:7:review_trigger: rebuild scope, interview answer, version selection, or implementation admission\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:17:This authority includes reviewable commits and draft PRs, but no merge, deploy,\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:98:Generated clients remain private. Preview uses its own backend. Runtime secrets\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md: