t. Replace obsolete commands, docs, skills, lint scopes and CI in the owning slice. Distinguish local, Preview, provider and Production proof. |\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:350:resource lifetime, or has a real independent reuse/substitution point. Each\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:402:the type side; structural review covers helper purpose, Schema ownership and\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:455:Manage retained TaxKit Production and one shared Preview PostHog project through\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:457:actual organisation/credentials in the reviewed provider plan. Local analytics\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:458:is disabled. Ordinary Previews are disabled; an explicit controlled Preview\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:459:proof can enable its Preview project. Production capture tokens are public\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:499:`deployment.environment.name=production|preview|development`. Bind repository,\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:548:Resolve that observed constraint through a reviewed design change before\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:554:on ordinary Preview teardown. Dashboards, tokens and destinations must have\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:563:redirect and `api.taxkit.dev`. Preview uses its own temporary native addresses\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:568:public DNS or DNSSEC has converged. Recheck current Alchemy domain and Preview\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:576:infrastructure inputs. Qualify local, Preview and custom-domain address behaviour\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:585:administration, independent query/readback and Turbo credentials have separate\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:588:Before each provider mutation, the reviewed version-matched plan must identify\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:590:duration, receipt, revocation, rollback and independent readback. Existing\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:606:| Tax rules/core/calculator owners and READMEs under `packages/core`, `packages/calculators`, `packages/rules/au/*` | Change required | Compatibility/type/input/interface corrections in T002/T004; preserve valid known results and rate tables. Owning package tests, whole test run, reviewed Changesets. |\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:612:| `alchemy.run.ts`, `packages/infrastructure`, `tools/docs-deployment/**`, deployment workflows and infrastructure README | Change required | Same-stage native pair, new graph admission, exact DNS/secrets/analytics/telemetry ownership in T003/T007/T008/T009. Current Alchemy types/tests and reviewed plans; retain ordinary native commands over a parallel verification framework. |\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:613:| `docs/runbooks/{docs-deployment,recovery}.md`, operations authority model, `tools/documentation/runbook-contract.json` and router pointers | Change required | Replace the one-DocsWebsite procedures with exact pair/domain/secret/analytics/signal plans and recovery in the owning slice. Revise any changed procedure target/command contract together. Docs/runbook checks plus authorised independent readback. |\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:622:cleanup. Require one fresh independent review of the substantive replacement;\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:623:reviewer count is not evidence. New abstractions need semantic weight, an owner,\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:655:automatically become runtime secrets, Turbo credentials or independent\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:754:its final review and shared-understanding confirmation before admitting\n   • turbo 2.11.7\n   • Packages in scope: //\n   • Running //#lint:task in 1 package\n   • Remote caching disabled, using shared worktree cache\n\n//:lint:task: cache miss, executing 5f5f9b2a