ery']['failed_observations'].append('The first new lint fixture pass used the wrong encoder rule label and omitted an import blank line; corrected fixture inputs and labels pass without changing lint policy. Existing owners are restored by scoped finalizers on all outcomes')\\np.write_text(json.dumps(d,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\np=Path('docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md')\\ns=p.read_text()\\ns+='''\\nThe private native RPC package is accepted and rejected by the installed lint\\nbinary at its own source/test/configuration paths. Exact temporary fixtures at\\nthe parser and two transport-test files prove the required decoding/encoding\\npermissions while rejecting runtime execution and unintended encoding. The\\nEffect test scope restores each real owner's original bytes on failure or\\ninterruption. A neighbouring RPC file still rejects decoding. These fixtures\\nqualify lint permissions; they do not prove a real browser or Worker connection.\\n'''\\np.write_text(s)\\np=Path('docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md')\\ns=p.read_text()\\ns+='''\\nThe final transport pass has 27 cases. All 25 workspace test tasks pass (24\\nmatching caches), including 428 actual lint cases. New exact RPC path fixtures\\nprove decoding/encoding permission limits and restore real source bytes on all\\noutcomes; a neighbouring source file still rejects decoding. Old and narrow\\nSchema exports retain the same five object identities in source and built\\nconsumers. Frozen install checks 793 installs across 1021 packages with no\\nchanges. Final full verification of these additional fixtures remains pending.\\n'''\\np.write_text(s)\\nPY\\npython3 .agents/skills/package-structure/scripts/validate_package.py packages/api/rpc\",max_output_tokens:1000}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1055e-488d-75e2-ab79-097882eda37b","create_time":1791132487.290658}}}
