s a fixed encoding\\\",\\n    \\\"Private generated client and test-only in-process Layer; no runtime in the package; checked expected/connection/reply/deadline errors, unrelated adapter defect identity and caller interruption preserved\\\",\\n    \\\"One whole-response five-second deadline includes header and body work; operation provides credential omission/redirect rejection\\\",\\n    \\\"Actual browser build exposed live modules imported by broad Schema roots; move canonical diagnostics and report/input definitions into narrow public Schema exports, preserving old entrypoints/class identities and retained calculations\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"proof\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"native compiler, canonical lint and private package test\\\",\\n      \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"pass: 27 native RPC tests in two files, actual POST/JSON handler/client, real calculator net pay 130100 cents at 165400 cents weekly gross, checked errors, pure/mixed defects, malformed JSON/envelopes/tags/IDs, version skew, invalid replies, exact independent SchemaError defect, deadlines/body/root-scope cleanup and operation policy\\\",\\n      \\\"logs\\\": [\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-tests.log\\\",\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-types.log\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"bun run build\\\",\\n      \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"pass: all 16 tasks, four matching caches; changed package/dependency builds execute\\\",\\n      \\\"logs\\\": [\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-root-build.log\\\",\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-root-build-final.log\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"SDK packed artifact and clean downstream consumer\\\",\\n      \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"pass: actual packed SDK 46-file import smoke and independent downstream type/runtime/exports/browser bundle; temporary workspaces removed; no adad mutation\\\",\\n      \\\"logs\\\": [\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-packed-sdk.log\\\",\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-downstream-sdk.log\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"private client browser build and output metadata inspection\\\",\\n      \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"pass: 161118-byte minified browser bundle; no retained live engine/calculator/rule-pack, RPC server, Alchemy, Node/Bun host or authored content modules; core RuleSourcePolicy is a 39-byte Schema definition rather than a live rule\\\",\\n      \\\"bundle_sha256\\\": \\\"dfdb72bf8b14f9b47335df3c34601ce10d0fea7a9fd3db9809ae32b20efb258d\\\",\\n      \\\"logs\\\": [\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-browser-bundle.log\\\",\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-client-browser.meta.json\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"Oversized-body test with one-MiB parser limit deliberately relaxed to two MiB, then restored\\\",\\n      \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"Expected failure: valid oversized JSON reaches real TakeHomePayReport when the limit is relaxed; original source restored in finally; passing test rejects this false green\\\",\\n      \\\"logs\\\": [\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-byte-limit-mutation.log\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"All nine private exports: Bun source condition, Node default ESM import and native compiler declaration consumer with source condition disabled\\\",\\n      \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"pass: actual source/default imports and emitted declaration resolution; no source-only fallback; private publication is N/A\\\",\\n      \\\"logs\\\": [\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-export-proof.log\\\",\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-declaration-resolution.log\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"bun run test\\\",\\n      \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"pass: 25 workspace tasks, 24 matching caches; fresh 27 RPC cases; 428 actual lint cases, including 21 new RPC positive/rejection cases; retained tax results unchanged\\\",\\n      \\\"logs\\\": [\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-root-tests-final.log\\\",\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-exact-lint-tests.log\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"Five old/narrow Schema export identities in source and built default consumers\\\",\\n      \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"pass: diagnostics, take-home report/input and annual report/input are the same objects at their old and new entrypoints\\\",\\n      \\\"logs\\\": [\\n        \\\"dev74-schema-identity.log\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"bun install --frozen-lockfile\\\",\\n      \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"pass: 793 installs across 1021 packages with no changes; native compiler hash already matches replacement\\\",\\n      \\\"logs\\\": [\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-frozen-install.log\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"bun run verification before the additional exact lint fixtures\\\",\\n      \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"pass: 32 Quality cases including 13 isolated command/failure cases in 375.73 seconds; 25 type tasks; both unused-code inventories; 206 deployment cases, 21 skill cases and 16 evaluation cases; actual Chromium 24 SDK and four website cases\\\",\\n      \\\"logs\\\": [\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-verification.log\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"limit\\\": \\\"The final run also needs to cover the subsequently added exact lint fixtures\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"Canonical package validator over unchanged source-only copy\\\",\\n      \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"pass: exact config digests and source/export/service separation; ignored dist, node_modules and .turbo outputs excluded from validator input; original caches preserved\\\",\\n      \\\"logs\\\": [\\n        \\\"dev74-rpc-package-structure.log\\\"\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"documentation_impact\\\": {\\n    \\\"Change required\\\": [\\n      \\\"packages/api/rpc/**\\\",\\n      \\\"packages/core/src/engine/schemas.ts and narrow export/README\\\",\\n      \\\"packages/rules/au/pay and income-tax canonical calculator Schema modules and narrow exports/READMEs\\\",\\n      \\\"packages/calculators/src/schemas.ts and README\\\",\\n      \\\"docs/architecture/api-and-sdk.md\\\",\\n      \\\"docs/architecture