rc/groups/health.ts(16,21): warning TS377136: `effect/http-api/OpenApi#Title` is an unstable API. Breaking changes may happen between versions. effect(unstableApiUsage)\\n1372:@taxkit/api-http:build: src/handlers/calculators.ts(40,56): warning TS377136: `effect/http-api/HttpApiBuilder#group` is an unstable API. Breaking changes may happen between versions. effect(unstableApiUsage)\\n1373:@taxkit/api-http:build: src/handlers/health.ts(6,49): warning TS377136: `effect/http-api/HttpApiBuilder#group` is an unstable API. Breaking changes may happen between versions. effect(unstableApiUsage)\\n1374:@taxkit/api-http:build: src/openapi.ts(5,41): warning TS377136: `effect/http-api/OpenApi#OpenAPISpec` is an unstable API. Breaking changes may happen between versions. effect(unstableApiUsage)\\n1375:@taxkit/api-http:build: src/openapi.ts(6,11): warning TS377136: `effect/http-api/OpenApi#fromApi` is an unstable API. Breaking changes may happen between versions. effect(unstableApiUsage)\\n1376:@taxkit/api-http:build: src/server/live.layer.ts(14,34): warning TS377136: `effect/http-api/HttpApiBuilder#layer` is an unstable API. Breaking changes may happen between versions. effect(unstableApiUsage)\\n1377:@taxkit/api-http:build: src/server/live.layer.ts(17,14): warning TS377136: `effect/http/HttpRouter#provideRequest` is an unstable API. Breaking changes may happen between versions. effect(unstableApiUsage)\\n1378:@taxkit/api-http:build: src/server/live.layer.ts(22,38): warning TS377136: `effect/http-api/HttpApiScalar#layer` is an unstable API. Breaking changes may happen between versions. effect(unstableApiUsage)\\n1379:@taxkit/api-http:build: src/server/live.layer.ts(26,38): warning TS377136: `effect/http/HttpRouter#add` is an unstable API. Breaking changes may happen between versions. effect(unstableApiUsage)\\n1380:@taxkit/api-http:build: src/server/live.layer.ts(29,37): warning TS377136: `effect/http/HttpServerResponse#jsonUnsafe` is an unstable API. Breaking changes may happen between versions. effect(unstableApiUsage)\\n1381:@taxkit/api-http:build: src/server/live.layer.ts(37,28): warning TS377136: `effect/http/HttpServer#layerServices` is an unstable API. Breaking changes may happen between versions. effect(unstableApiUsage)\\n1382:@taxkit/api-http:build: src/server/live.layer.ts(38,28): warning TS377136: `effect/http/HttpRouter#cors` is an unstable API. Breaking changes may happen between versions. effect(unstableApiUsage)\\n1425:web:build: .vercel/output/functions/__server.func/_ssr/start-D2wfqogf.mjs                    0.14 kB │ gzip:   0.13 kB\\n1655:web:test:browser:    Duration  2.59s (import 47%, worker 28%, tests 25%)\\n1658: Tasks:    9 successful, 9 total\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"8f2f0b\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000013917,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":696,\"output\":\"## T003 native RPC contract (in progress)\\n\\nStart T003 from locally accepted foundation commit\\n`5d9e9ab21ed7ce5687cea560c1db3ebe658bd375` ([draft 127](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/127)).\\nIts GitHub Quality run `37215859846` was in progress at creation; this is not\\nhosted acceptance. The new private `packages/api/rpc` is rendered through the\\ncanonical package tool, then adapted to the actual stable Effect 4 exports and\\nTaxKit calculator owners. The template's generic catalogue, RC imports and\\nNDJSON do not describe this bounded POST/JSON calculation contract.\\n\\nThe handler calls `PublicCalculatorService.calculate`; request and result\\nSchemas remain calculator-owned. A checked native-parser ingress prevents\\nunchecked tags/IDs reaching native identity encoding. Per-procedure and global\\nnative defects use fixed safe encoding. The scoped generated client distinguishes\\nexpected failures, unavailable transport, invalid replies and one whole-response\\ndeadline; unrelated adapter defects and earlier interruption retain their\\nclassification. Focused native tests pass the real calculator and failure/body\\npaths; complete slice checks and the two real app hosts remain pending.\\n\\nDocumentation impact: **Change required** for the new package README/exports,\\ntransport/package/quality architecture, exact boundary permissions, Knip entries,\\nlockfile, Changeset, task ledger and dated receipt. **Preserve** calculators,\\npublic HTTP/OpenAPI, existing app and provider wiring, canonical skills,\\nhistorical receipts and retained tax outcomes. Provider runbooks are **N/A** for\\nthis contract-only step because no provider graph or command changes. T003 stays\\nin progress until actual API/Website, binding, origin, browser and lifetime proof\\npasses. No merge, provider operation or publication is authorised.\\n\\nA subsequent readback confirms GitHub Quality `37215859846` passed the exact\\nfoundation commit `5d9e9ab21ed7ce5687cea560c1db3ebe658bd375`. It does not qualify\\nthis new T003 candidate. The [RPC receipt](../../documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-05-native-rpc-contract.json)\\nrecords 27 native cases, the observed broad-Schema browser import correction,\\nlocal package/SDK proof and remaining app-host requirements.\\n\\nThe final transport pass has 27 cases. All 25 workspace test tasks pass (24\\nmatching caches), including 428 actual lint cases. New exact RPC path fixtures\\nprove decoding/encoding permission limits and restore real source bytes on all\\noutcomes; a neighbouring source file still rejects decoding. Old and narrow\\nSchema exports retain the same five object identities in source and built\\nconsumers. Frozen install checks 793 installs across 1021 packages with no\\nchanges. Final full verification of these additional fixtures remains pending.\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"09aea8\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000005833,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":603,\"output\":\"{\\n  \\\"schemaVersion\\\": 1,\\n  \\\"kind\\\": \\\"rpc\\\",\\n  \\\"packageName\\\": \\\"@taxkit/api-rpc\\\",\\n  \\\"domainPackage\\\": \\\"@taxkit/calculators\\\",\\n  \\\"sourceCondition\\\": \\\"source\\\",\\n  \\\"versionSnapshot\\\": {\\n    \\\"resolvedAt\\\": \\\"2026-10-05\\\",\\n    \\\"sha256\\\": \\\"2938a67efef3b517b5ac520871b39b92027ce10258d62f8c6fd11b94d20988aa\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"officialSources\\\": {\\n    \\\"effect\\\": \\\"https://github.com/Effect-TS/effect\\\",\\n    \\\"typescript\\\": \\\"https://github.com/microsoft/typescript-go\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"selectedVersions\\\": {\\n    \\\"effect\\\": \\\"4.0.0\\\",\\n    \\\"typescript\\\": \\\"7.0.2\\\",\\n    \\\"vitest\\\": \\\"5.0.3\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"compatibilityDecisions\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"qualified\\\",\\n      \\\"decision\\\": \\\"Use TaxKit installed stable Effect 4.0.0 and native TypeScript 7.0.2, rather than canonical templates rc.117 snapshot\\\",\\n      \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-05-foundation-acceptance-review.json\\\",\\n      \\\"limitation\\\": \\\"RPC templates still require adaptation and runtime qualification before acceptance\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"configDigests\\\": {\\n    \\\"package.json\\\": \\\"8d9c28ace1a255d4e78aa318a702c18f1b1563a43e98b2805c6216f07e281ba0\\\",\\n    \\\"tsconfig.json\\\": \\\"d6ff2031891c11e64e335f72ba07787615e93b4ef1e6eb54f07be29b34edd1f9\\\",\\n    \\\"tsconfig.build.json\\\": \\\"044f58d619deef8e2416a1fce0a3418879aac27f2aa5d70b245a4c774acac230\\\",\\n    \\\"vitest.config.ts\\\": \\\"c81a2a24fc321eaa98816ca4b8e42bd601c6406b7bd48d3e8a5bd450dcc2faeb\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"limitations\\\": [\\n    \\\"Structural rendering does not prove installed dependency, declaration, runtime, or packed-consumer behavior.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"nonClaims\\\": [\\\"Selected versions are not claimed to remain latest.\\\"],\\n  \\\"originalScaffoldConfigDigests\\\": {\\n    \\\"package.json\\\": \\\"529fd22d74c2cadf26524bec9099d8636cbe8b3eef22429977b824197e5e3061\\\",\\n    \\\"tsconfig.json\\\": \\\"71596163cd8ffea16eb4950049bc772ec8a8e2db408759c80bc8232aa40a6d99\\\",\\n    \\\"tsconfig.build.json\\\": \\\"320b70b4115224df6a42038a8759a444d0feecabb0666c22a519904a1e9b9de9\\\",\\n    \\\"vitest.config.ts\\\": \\\"0be6a110349188c59f6651c3e6cc19543b37c18cb1d8b9c4d40666709122798e\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"adaptation\\\": {\\n    \\\"date\\\": \\\"2026-10-05\\\",\\n    \\\"scope\\\": \\\"Explicit native stable Effect 4 POST/JSON calculation and checked parser/reply hooks, over existing TaxKit Schemas/services\\\",\\n    \\\"proof\\\": \\\"Focused native compiler, canonical lint and 27 actual native transport/lifetime cases; complete slice checks pending\\\",\\n    \\\"limitations\\\": \\\"Not real app, browser CORS, hosted Worker, service binding, tracing export or provider proof\\\"\\n  }\\n}\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"909f93\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000007166,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":307,\"output\":\"Adds a private native Effect 4 POST/JSON calculation connection for DEV-74. The checked client calls the existing calculator service, keeps one five-second limit through response decoding, and preserves caller cancellation. Native request checks and fixed error encoding keep private inputs out of the tested reply and log paths.\\n\\nSeparates the existing report/input Schemas from live calculation imports and adds narrow exports. Old imports keep the same Schema objects and tax results. The browser client bundle no longer retains live engine, calculator or rule-pack implementations.\\n\\nValidation: 27 native RPC tests; a deliberate byte-limit break is caught; source/default/declaration import checks; actual SDK packed and clean downstream checks; full workspace tests/build and repository verification. Exact outcomes and limits are recorded in `docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-05-native-rpc-contract.json`.\\n\\nThis is a draft stacked on #127. DEV-74 remains in progress: the real API/Website, same-stage binding, browser CORS and complete native trace/failure checks still require implementation. No merge, deploy, publication, version application, provider change or Medicare correction is included.\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1055e-488d-75e2-ab79-097882eda37b","create_time":1791133130.010811}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
